con.png","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Nv2fQJo5/icon.png","issues_url":"https://github.com/ReplayMod/ReplayMod/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/ReplayMod/ReplayMod","wiki_url":"https://www.replaymod.com/docs/","discord_url":"https://discord.gg/5GR7RSb","donation_urls":[{"id":"patreon","platform":"Patreon","url":"https://www.patreon.com/replaymod"}],"gallery":[],"color":813980,"thread_id":"Nv2fQJo5","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.3"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"Ro7i9i6T","slug":"verdant-fields","project_type":"mod","team":"9AHbfqDB","organization":null,"title":"Verdant Fields","description":"An immersive vanilla friendly nature expansion introducing vibrant rainforests, colossal tiered mahogany giants, falling jackfruits, dangerous piranhas, and decorative flora.","body":"***\\n\\n# 🌿 Verdant Fields\\n\\n**Verdant Fields** expands Minecraft’s wilderness with vibrant, multi-layered biomes, interactive wild flora, and vanilla-friendly mechanics designed to make exploring and building feel alive again.\\n\\nFrom dense tropical canopies and sun-drenched palm shores to naturally weathered forests across the entire world, the wilderness has never felt this dynamic.\\n\\n***\\n\\n## 🌴 What\'s in the mod?\\n\\n### 🗺️ World Generation & Biomes\\n\\n*   **Tropical Rainforest:** A dense multi-tiered jungle dominated by towering Mahogany trees, hanging vines, and lush undergrowth.\\n    *   *Small & Mega Mahogany:* Varied tree shapes forming a realistic, thick canopy.\\n    *   *Massive Mahogany:* Landmark emergent giants rising far above the tree line.\\n*   **Bamboo Rainforest:** A secluded, lush variant where giant mahoganies intertwine with dense bamboo groves.\\n*   **Sparse Rainforest:** Airy transitional woodlands with open meadows, scattered bushes, and sunlit clearings.\\n*   **Beaches:** Vanilla beaches are now dotted with leaning **Palm Trees** that stretch out toward the ocean.\\n*   **Fallen Trees Worldwide:** Forests are no longer static. Mossy, weathered fallen logs now naturally generate across **every vanilla biome** matching its native tree type (Oaks in forests, Birches in birch forests, Spruces in taigas, and more).\\n\\n***\\n\\n### 🪵 Hollow Logs & Complete Timber Sets\\n\\nTransform how you build, detail, and navigate the wild:\\n\\n*   **Hollow Logs:** All tree types now feature fully traversable, decorative **Hollow Logs**:\\n    *   **13 Wood Variants:** All 11 vanilla wood types + Mahogany + Palm.\\n    *   **13 Stripped Variants:** Clean, debarked hollow logs for refined builds.\\n    *   *Perfect for natural terrain detailing, crawlspaces, hidden pathways, or rustic piping.*\\n*   **Palm Woodset:** Craft a full coastal building palette including planks, stairs, slabs, fences, doors, trapdoors, and boats.\\n*   **Mahogany Woodset:** A deep, rich timber collection featuring doors, trapdoors, fences, signs, hanging signs, and boats.\\n*   **Red Bamboo Set:** A rich crimson alternative to vanilla bamboo, complete with custom planks, mosaics, and rafts.\\n\\n***\\n\\n### 🥥 Coconuts & Tree Farming\\n\\n*   **Growing Coconuts:** Clustered under the fronds of beach palms, coconuts advance through distinct visual growth stages.\\n*   **Watch Your Head:** Hit a coconut down or let gravity do the work! Falling coconuts damage anything caught below.\\n*   **Snack or Decor:** Crack them open for a refreshing food source, or harvest fully grown coconuts using a **Silk Touch Pickaxe** to place them as decorative blocks anywhere you like.\\n\\n***\\n\\n### 🍈 The Heavy Jackfruit\\n\\n*   **Log Farming:** Plant **Jackfruit Seeds** directly onto logs to grow nature’s largest tree-borne fruit.\\n*   **Falling Physics:** Shoot down ripe fruit to crush unsuspecting mobs below. Upon landing, they split into fresh **Jackfruit Slices** and replantable seeds.\\n\\n***\\n\\n### 🌺 Exotic Flora & Ancient Botany\\n\\n*   **Torchflower Bush:** A thriving, ancient relative of the Torchflower that naturally emits a soft, warm glow and gentle ambient pollen particles.\\n*   **Staghorn Ferns:** Epiphytic ferns that grow directly on the sides of logs and horizontal branches.\\n*   **Jungle Undergrowth:** Wild Monstera patches, vibrant Strelitzias (Bird of Paradise), and bellflowers.\\n*   **Wetland Flora:** Riverbanks and ponds are populated by water lilies, floating duckweed, and tall cattails.\\n\\n***\\n\\n### 🐟 Wildlife & River Dangers\\n\\n*   **Piranhas:** Aggressive river predators that hunt in fast-swimming schools. Keep your guard up in tropical waters, fight them off, or catch one in a **Water Bucket**.\\n\\n***\\n\\n### ⚔️ Underground & Metallurgy\\n\\n*   **Silver Gear:** Mine deep underground silver veins to craft a complete set of armor, tools, and swift combat spears built for wilderness expeditions.\\n\\n***\\n\\n## ❓ FAQ & Modpacks\\n\\n*   **Can I use this in my modpack?**  \\n    Yes, absolutely! You are free to include *Verdant Fields* in any public or private modpack.\\n*   **Compatibility:**  \\n    Built for modern versions of Minecraft (Fabric & NeoForge), fully compatible with vanilla worldgen tags and major world generation mods.","body_url":null,"published":"2026-09-04T11:40:36.812850Z","updated":"2026-11-03T17:36:30.402895Z","approved":"2026-09-30T09:41:22.928832Z","queued":"2026-09-04T21:40:37.211221Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":454,"followers":13,"categories":["adventure","food","worldgen"],"additional_categories":["decoration"],"loaders":["fabric","neoforge"],"versions":["J2y0j1at","QMH8lu70","DEZS8Fuc","nu3phW6h","9lxDUi9O","pvKfrwjn","4hXCUZ4p","XSXkWbKc","DH0OGitv","RJLNL6FB"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/a9fab39b1fa6335477092b8194758b89263771ed_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/a9fab39b1fa6335477092b8194758b89263771ed.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.gg/Ffz8SRCpV4","donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/413246e5b3ea23ae6775076c60173c6a820ce9c4_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/413246e5b3ea23ae6775076c60173c6a820ce9c4.png","featured":false,"title":"piranhas","description":null,"created":"2026-09-04T20:49:04.324053Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/3c466ad9a5c9de7918413893a23dcf440a0a9d46_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/3c466ad9a5c9de7918413893a23dcf440a0a9d46.png","featured":false,"title":"jackfruit","description":null,"created":"2026-09-04T20:49:18.929161Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/69116e8e00470af4b7f1d1578e63b1ee20eab31b_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/69116e8e00470af4b7f1d1578e63b1ee20eab31b.png","featured":false,"title":"mahogany wood","description":null,"created":"2026-09-04T20:49:32.087435Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/fd205acd4c5540bd1afaf8e6e4bfa5250f189829_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/fd205acd4c5540bd1afaf8e6e4bfa5250f189829.png","featured":false,"title":"piranhas items","description":null,"created":"2026-09-04T20:49:48.317037Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/d815279a9591c92c86ba53c0e2ba795c13a89fca_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/d815279a9591c92c86ba53c0e2ba795c13a89fca.png","featured":false,"title":"rainforest","description":null,"created":"2026-09-04T20:50:05.018486Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/ad6f769de6aae57d4d666ddf3267e3796cbe30bb_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/ad6f769de6aae57d4d666ddf3267e3796cbe30bb.png","featured":false,"title":"silver blocks, tools and armor","description":"Silver ores and items,\\nSilver tools and weapons\\nSilver armor set","created":"2026-09-04T20:50:59.243063Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/a67b868c802f67e5ef5a6b482d07969c99c91959_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/a67b868c802f67e5ef5a6b482d07969c99c91959.png","featured":false,"title":"waterlilies duckweed and cattail","description":"rainforest aquatic plants: 6 variants of flowered water lilies, duckweed and cattail","created":"2026-09-04T20:57:36.408711Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/6763d57f03c046eedb10b231019529ca3990e2d6_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/6763d57f03c046eedb10b231019529ca3990e2d6.png","featured":false,"title":"bamboo rainforest","description":null,"created":"2026-09-30T13:32:57.794221Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/b1259359a80cfb2d16f8daef887c973b6dd6870f_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ro7i9i6T/images/b1259359a80cfb2d16f8daef887c973b6dd6870f.png","featured":false,"title":"hollow log","description":null,"created":"2026-11-03T13:45:09.304275Z","ordering":0}],"color":4345637,"thread_id":"1slfCqmq","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"optional","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20","1.20.1"],"environment":[],"id":"t5GPHFJt","slug":"glaciaries-variants-saints-dragons","project_type":"mod","team":"KFB5qYMf","organization":null,"title":"Glaciarie\'s Variants [Saint\'s Dragons]","description":"Variant pack that adds new dragon variants to Saint\'s Dragons.","body":"Dragon variant pack made by me! This pack adds several new dragon variants for the [Saint\'s Dragons](https://modrinth.com/mod/saints-dragons) mod.\\n\\n\\n\\n### How to get the variants to show ingame:\\n\\nDue to how the Saint\'s Dragon mod works, for this pack to work it will require both a datapack and a resource pack. The file provided is both of those packaged into one.\\n\\n- Download the file zip file avaiable.\\n- Add add it to your resource packs folder, it will then function as the resource pack.\\n- Make a copy of the zip and add it to your world\'s datapack folder.\\n- When you open the game, check the resource pack screen in the options menu, Glaciarie\'s Variants should be on the available list, you have to move it to selected.\\n\\n\\n### Credits\\nAll credits to the Saint\'s Dragons team. Get the mod [here](https://modrinth.com/mod/saints-dragons)!","body_url":null,"published":"2026-10-04T21:36:43.657281Z","updated":"2026-10-22T16:53:05.482301Z","approved":"2026-10-05T05:50:39.984541Z","queued":"2026-10-05T01:01:40.926507Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial No Derivatives 4.0 International","url":null},"downloads":683,"followers":10,"categories":["adventure","mobs","transportation"],"additional_categories":["entities"],"loaders":["datapack","minecraft"],"versions":["ybdjGJQN","GKogHH22","sCr6JnfB"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/36a54171a4538c08e65c9f6388c51339c1d5d11e_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/36a54171a4538c08e65c9f6388c51339c1d5d11e.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.com/invite/5h7jARyaFk","donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/6d68a7668f3157bc631c57d9ddf44b47969663b1_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/6d68a7668f3157bc631c57d9ddf44b47969663b1.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Lagoon and Lilac Varasuchus.","created":"2026-10-04T23:02:42.822009Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/8131ea4a2dcba15805799d52c805dc110ab09e8c_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/8131ea4a2dcba15805799d52c805dc110ab09e8c.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Ruby, Lagoon and Lilac Varasuchus. ","created":"2026-10-05T00:32:36.484084Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/5f4fdaf4d9acd0b7605b875f68beda229df4bfc5_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/5f4fdaf4d9acd0b7605b875f68beda229df4bfc5.png","featured":true,"title":null,"description":"Twilight and Passion Volitans, Cobalt Ignivorus, Radioactive Raevyx.","created":"2026-10-05T00:27:33.128403Z","ordering":1},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/0d019e04769a055165aef2379b1f74bdb0dd9811_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/0d019e04769a055165aef2379b1f74bdb0dd9811.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Dandelion, Daydream, Boiga and Sunstorm Cindervanes. Cobalt Ignivorus.","created":"2026-10-04T23:00:56.471963Z","ordering":2},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/68504365371d690d20dba325c150e0edff1dee82_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/68504365371d690d20dba325c150e0edff1dee82.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Dreamfire, Dandelion and Boiga Cindervanes.","created":"2026-10-05T00:26:14.374778Z","ordering":3},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/8372916d41cbdc54c506b471b593bc00d0291b20_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/8372916d41cbdc54c506b471b593bc00d0291b20.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Twilight Volitans.","created":"2026-10-04T23:04:31.588275Z","ordering":4},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/0a6d79f2bd58c928f48735b26230f254c9e6ac29_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/0a6d79f2bd58c928f48735b26230f254c9e6ac29.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Nether Quartz Stegonaut.","created":"2026-10-04T23:05:08.270209Z","ordering":5},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/12e43a48e816717b7aa2f104b1f6b183cc7d9372_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/12e43a48e816717b7aa2f104b1f6b183cc7d9372.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Nether Quartz Stegonaut and Ruby Varasuchus.","created":"2026-10-05T00:30:03.224283Z","ordering":6},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/58b119355eec7331bcaa98158cbecf6f3b648988_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/58b119355eec7331bcaa98158cbecf6f3b648988.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Palewing, Lodestar and Radioactive Raevyx.","created":"2026-10-05T00:28:37.754514Z","ordering":7},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/ffa01cda31c0659933b5599e1d34fc8e57bb0123_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/ffa01cda31c0659933b5599e1d34fc8e57bb0123.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Albino Nulljaw.","created":"2026-10-05T00:26:46.704307Z","ordering":8},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/518b9693b5ff8f25be1ea0b3592e5a1ea9f9b627_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/518b9693b5ff8f25be1ea0b3592e5a1ea9f9b627.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Inkwell Volitans, Greygnarl Ignivorus and Sea Serpent Atroxiia.","created":"2026-10-10T17:13:10.660266Z","ordering":9},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/4bfa3cfda92bcb46b8dd2833a1f39f068249c70e_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/4bfa3cfda92bcb46b8dd2833a1f39f068249c70e.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Palewing and Warpath Raevyx.","created":"2026-10-10T17:13:46.922018Z","ordering":10},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/43775b2e51b3752c6dd7b71a2d468d2bde693340_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/43775b2e51b3752c6dd7b71a2d468d2bde693340.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Echo Shard Stegonaut.","created":"2026-10-10T17:19:11.527916Z","ordering":11},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/04481dee858ac9e68f1230153de1a87d5f6ca16b_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/04481dee858ac9e68f1230153de1a87d5f6ca16b.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Baryakh Varasuchus.","created":"2026-10-10T17:15:17.981364Z","ordering":12},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/d300ec9c481de03ebf57989751e57fa0c8c37eb1_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/d300ec9c481de03ebf57989751e57fa0c8c37eb1.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Faux Raevyx, Sunset and Seaside Cindervane.","created":"2026-10-10T17:16:07.190662Z","ordering":13},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/7779063531163a6f2b7c14fd22a7d825e8704869_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/t5GPHFJt/images/7779063531163a6f2b7c14fd22a7d825e8704869.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Oceanic Raevyx.","created":"2026-10-10T17:17:56.812808Z","ordering":14}],"color":3686774,"thread_id":"UOjnMUQY","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20.1","1.21","1.21.1","26.1.2"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"uJ9afomy","slug":"ae2-crystal-science","project_type":"mod","team":"Ouicj52g","organization":null,"title":"AE2 Crystal Science","description":"An addon for AE2 that brings back the Purified Crystal concept and builds a full progression around it.","body":"<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/3xfyMDH.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Header Image\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n## Overview\\n\\n**Applied Energistics: Crystal Science (AECS)** is an addon for Applied Energistics 2 that brings back the **Purified Crystal** concept and builds a full progression around it.\\n\\nWith a production chain of **Dust → Seeds → Growth** and dedicated machines (Grindstone / Pulverizer / Growth Chamber / Aggregator), you can mass-produce purified crystals for mid-to-late game crafting and energy generation.  \\nOn the other side, AECS adds stronger pattern execution and wireless channel solutions (Meteorite/Resonating Pattern Providers, Ender Emitter & Ender Broadcaster) to build more powerful automation.\\n\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/QAPoFkY.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"All items and blocks added by AECS including crystals, machines, tools, and ME devices\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### 1) Purified Crystal Progression\\n*Dust → Seeds → Growth*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/9RkETD6.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Quartz Grindstone interface showing dust processing for purified crystal production\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/DR9Q7w7.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crafting recipes for crystal seeds made from processed dust\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/3JQirA3.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal seeds placed in growth environment before maturation\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/u76f3Zb.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Multiple growth stages of purified crystal seeds until fully grown crystals\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 2) Crystal Tools\\n*Ender / Meteorite / Resonating toolsets.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/0hKsxyd.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal-based toolsets including Ender, Meteorite, and Resonating variants\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 3) Machine Side Configuration\\n*Configure each face for input/output/bidirectional/disabled, and automate import/export behavior.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/DoPGLag.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Machine side configuration GUI showing per-face input and output settings\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 4) Quartz Grindstone\\n*Kickstart dust production with a simple, low-tech grinder.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/AllePlU.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Quartz Grindstone block placed in the world\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/9RkETD6.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Quartz Grindstone user interface for grinding materials into dust\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 5) Crystal Pulverizer\\n*Higher throughput crushing with automation-friendly IO and upgrades.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/ZKBd0mG.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal Pulverizer block with industrial appearance\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/ryyQhS9.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal Pulverizer GUI showing input, output, and upgrade slots\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 6) Crystal Growth Chamber\\n*Grow stacks of seeds in parallel—built for scaling and speed upgrades.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/njpthkJ.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal Growth Chamber block designed for large-scale seed growth\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/4ohfuox.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal Growth Chamber interface showing parallel seed growth\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 7) Crystal Aggregator\\n*A central machine for key recipes and high-efficiency seed scaling.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/hRyeiBi.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal Aggregator block used for advanced crystal processing\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/dIXfL2u.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Crystal Aggregator GUI displaying recipe processing and scaling\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 8) Circuit Etcher\\n*Simplifies processor crafting by consolidating steps into a dedicated machine.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/osIE1Qv.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Circuit Etcher block used for processor crafting\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/pUka89C.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Circuit Etcher interface consolidating multiple processor crafting steps\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 9) Meteorite Pattern Provider\\n*Processes crafting patterns internally and provides 63 pattern slots for large-scale automation.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/7M1aI4U.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Meteorite Pattern Provider block with expanded pattern capacity\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/kDHwoiJ.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Meteorite Pattern Provider GUI showing 63 available pattern slots\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 10) Resonating Pattern System\\n*Assign per-ingredient destinations/sides for advanced routing and complex factories.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/v4ONsqS.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Resonating Pattern Provider block used for advanced pattern routing\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/Lh7j1QC.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Resonating Pattern routing interface with per-ingredient destination settings\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 11) Ender Broadcaster\\n*A wireless channel system that centralizes channel management and allocates channels on demand.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/XPQlOcv.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Ender Broadcaster usage view showing connected devices\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/EzTreFG.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Ender Broadcaster band management interface\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/SC4TqJn.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Ender Broadcaster receiver usage view displaying channel allocation\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/zSKplMF.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Ender Broadcaster link usage view showing wireless channel connections\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n### 12) Ender Emitter\\n*Automatically links nearby ME devices to your network for cleaner wiring and reduced cabling.*\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/9YML19O.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Ender Emitter block placed near ME devices\\"\\n  />\\n  <img\\n    src=\\"https://i.imgur.com/q3YGthC.png\\"\\n    width=\\"90%\\"\\n    alt=\\"Ender Emitter automatically linking nearby ME devices wirelessly\\"\\n  />\\n</p>\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Other Info\\n\\n### Optional Mod Integrations\\nSome purified crystal recipes are **only added when the corresponding mod is installed**.\\n\\nSupported integrations include:\\n- **ExtendedAE** – Purified Entro Crystal\\n- **AdvancedAE** – Purified Quantum Crystal\\n- **Applied Fluix** – Purified Redstone Crystal\\n- **Applied Generators** – Purified Ember Crystal\\n- **Create** – Purified Rose Quartz\\n- **Mekanism** – Purified Irradiated Crystal\\n\\n### JEI / EMI Support\\nFull integration with **JEI** and **EMI** is provided.\\n\\n### Dark Mode Resource Pack\\nPrefer a darker look? Try the dark-mode resource pack:\\n- **[AECS Dark Mode](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/aecs-dark-mode)**\\n\\n### In-Game Guide\\nThe mod includes a **complete and detailed in-game guide powered by GuideME**,\\ncovering all systems, machines, crystals.  \\nNo external wiki is required to get started.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## License\\n\\nThis project uses a multi-license structure:\\n\\n- **Code**: [LGPL-3.0-or-later](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Frostbite-time/AE2-Crystal-Science/refs/heads/1.21.1/LICENSES/LGPL-3.0.txt)\\n- **Assets** (textures, models): [CC BY-NC-SA 3.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/)\\n\\nSee [LICENSE](https://github.com/Frostbite-time/AE2-Crystal-Science/blob/1.21.1/LICENSE) for full details.\\n","body_url":null,"published":"2026-01-18T13:24:05.329811Z","updated":"2026-07-24T09:57:06.078329Z","approved":"2026-01-25T02:12:45.956333Z","queued":"2026-01-18T13:50:57.250985Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":"https://github.com/Frostbite-time/AE2-Crystal-Science/blob/1.21.1/LICENSE"},"downloads":131144,"followers":17,"categories":["technology","transportation"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["forge","neoforge"],"versions":["gkP8DuKQ","ICQgFwj4","tNqIbVWE","LKbkwQkf","YwyR8xds","qGcxpjQ5","ymYVinc8","7feqDcc3","iejV7mEP","xBeEHEwu","grPcKcqb","8icRweax","ljLcGP7u","yocUjT2t","vVCe5sPS","p2yuQ67y","8utlc1El","K3xpfGKM","d7WJgjCJ","WzfmNoo1","ZUA4eiHe","tR95Zs0m","U1lTlbty","N5ikeQGg","ReXfuIoE","emZMlvJn","iZWZ6ORO","8rSBbVlC","1lwSJ3qz","GmMsMiWc","t9IMQi3V","PP2uuQ6t","9wyPpLcp","VGhHOKsP","4W20Zp4P","taIhgdOA"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/ec7e1b5a65501be3462ba7230fcdf6c76c7f55dd.png","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/ec7e1b5a65501be3462ba7230fcdf6c76c7f55dd.png","issues_url":"https://github.com/Frostbite-time/AE2-Crystal-Science/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/Frostbite-time/AE2-Crystal-Science","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.gg/WbCHZ3MR","donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/a602f5e8d257fb45e766a215d05a3e6f2c9f22d7_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/a602f5e8d257fb45e766a215d05a3e6f2c9f22d7.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-01-18T13:33:34.426036Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/6714ef46e913e8aa5b8778e5f10f30ab1fbc6714_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/6714ef46e913e8aa5b8778e5f10f30ab1fbc6714.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-01-18T13:33:46.173028Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/453a652d785397960036a25783ac127e88024a9d_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/453a652d785397960036a25783ac127e88024a9d.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-01-18T13:34:05.420719Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/4d5861aff750a6acdeeebf7ebc24c854084eb2f8_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/4d5861aff750a6acdeeebf7ebc24c854084eb2f8.png","featured":true,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-01-18T13:34:26.251512Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/24f98a09f70b384b427657b67257320cabb18bb8.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uJ9afomy/images/24f98a09f70b384b427657b67257320cabb18bb8.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-01-18T13:34:59.955742Z","ordering":0}],"color":6985410,"thread_id":"NOIvOZpj","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"unsupported","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["server_only"],"id":"APoK4lLp","slug":"lossy-chat","project_type":"mod","team":"9G3XWRa3","organization":null,"title":"Lossy Chat","description":"Add packet loss to your chat messages","body":"**Lossy Chat** works like your usual \\"local/global chat\\" mod with a twist: messages at various distances have a chance to be corrupted while going really far away hides them completely\\n\\n\\nHovering on signal strength indicator shows strength for closest recipient and the number of them in total:\\n\\n![Hovering on the indicator at 75% strength](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/29ae1f0c26378070898993c842f125dbe3b0bcb3.png)\\n![Nobody heard that message](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/641fc160cefd6a286963d2613746c102c5bc21be.png)\\n\\nHovering on signal strength on others\' messages only shows signal level:\\n\\n![Hovering on message from other player](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c64e7873a2c793f594edd499d883b21758876f0.png)\\n\\nOptionally (on the server side) you can also let people see original messages by hovering on them:\\n![Hovering on scrambled message reveals its original text](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9800a8752c1816039e72665455ddcb098ec0422d.png)\\n\\n### Future plans\\n - [+] Implement shouting\\n - [ ] Fabric version\\n - [ ] Port to other versions","body_url":null,"published":"2026-07-23T13:47:33.312533Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:20:31.344393Z","approved":"2026-07-28T19:05:07.060378Z","queued":"2026-07-23T14:04:10.249478Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":534,"followers":18,"categories":["cursed","social"],"additional_categories":["adventure","game-mechanics"],"loaders":["neoforge"],"versions":["rEkWvH9A","KwDEVura"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/APoK4lLp/4bdd4bdf9ab63027bfe604549d754160b1eb62f1.png","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/APoK4lLp/4bdd4bdf9ab63027bfe604549d754160b1eb62f1.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":"https://git.being.pet/hkc/lossy-chat","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[],"color":15527148,"thread_id":"UzSiVeqJ","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"TVje4pU2","slug":"tijons-epic-arsenal","project_type":"mod","team":"UjLpRbrX","organization":null,"title":"Tijōn\'s Epic Arsenal","description":"Tac Z\'s firearms are now fully compatible with Epic Fight!","body":"<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/CYbHB2LL1Zg\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n\\n![Epic Arsenal Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/730ac4af6de53c347abf8b48ec8e682e242eb781_0.webp)Tijōn\'s Epic Arsenal is a comprehensive compatibility mod that seamlessly integrates Tac Z\'s firearms with the Epic Fight mod, enabling full animation synchronization for all combat actions. This mod ensures that every shooting, reloading, and aiming animation is properly handled through Epic Fight\'s animation system, providing a cohesive and immersive tactical combat experience.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n![header1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0bc0fa12d59e8ba0972a6df36ce7b9e4015a26cd.png)\\n![ex1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe29b5589553820a126134beb5de80bc80969fa9.gif)\\n\\n📙 Completely Integrated Shooting Animations: All firearm shooting actions are synchronized with Epicfight\'s animation framework. Meaning now for the first time ever you can fully play third person Tac Z with full epic fight animation support, featuring animations made completely from scratch by Tijōn & merlin204.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n![header2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/130996d700adac2cdc77e1c313ef4e4ec437befc.png)\\n\\n![ex2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8ca7b6ded9fbdbde839a724c4e7ef91a2257e722.gif)\\n♻️ Reload Animations: Full reload sequences for each firearm type, including tactical reloads and empty reloads.\\n\\n\\n![ex3](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66d215b2c9d20bff6b3846175215a30773561001.gif)\\n🔫 Aiming System: Proper aiming animations with appropriate stance adjustments for different weapon types\\n\\n⚔️ Visible Weapons: All weapons are visible on your character while moving in Epic Arsenal mode, just like in the original Tac Z mod!\\n\\n![ex4](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/99ed9c989513663ebeff84b38c9bd87ecef821ff.gif)\\n\\n🔪 Melee Animations: Each weapon type within reason has a working melee animation for third person routed to the same keybind as the original melee in first person, and yes; it auto switches between animations when in 1st or 3rd person!\\n\\n📸 Auto Pov Switch: Camera is set up to allow players to seamlessly switch between Epic Arsenal Animations in third person and standard Tac Z animations in 1st person\\n\\n📦 Auto Gun Sorting: Our mod is coded to automatically sort any gun add ons from Tac Z into one of the animation types by Tac Z gun categories, meaning EVERY Tac Z add on should automatically be supported in third person with our animation framework.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n![header3](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2ad974c744d150156f8d06823359f1376ed53af7.png)\\n![ex6](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3930ba480ce0476e0b547aa4d99bf827c6122785.gif)\\n\\n🛟 Smooth Transitions: Fluid transitions between combat stances and regular movement.\\n\\n🎮 Seamless Integration: Configured to work with most modern Epic Fight or Tac Z add ons, as well as supporting full on controller support and third person action camera through latest Epic Fight + Controlify\\n\\n🎯 Preset Weapon Categories The mod comes pre-configured with five optimized firearm categories:\\n\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Spoiler</summary>\\n\\nPISTOL\\n\\nSHOTGUN\\n\\nMINIGUN \\n\\nLAUNCHER \\n\\nRIFLE \\n\\nSNIPER\\n\\nTHROWABLES\\n\\n+ MORE\\n\\n+ Magazine swap reloads\\n\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n![header4](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e28839576557c851be8837c791597341e6a7e837.png)\\n\\n⚙️ Configuration System All compatibility settings are managed through epic_arsenal-common.toml configuration file. This has been made easily accessible from within game and allows modular additions of any gun mods by adding them to the appropriate gun type whitelist.\\n\\n\\n\\nThis is my first ever mod, be nice lol\\n\\nCredit for all the coding that actually made the mod work is 100% merlin204! Dude is a beast!","body_url":null,"published":"2026-02-20T00:17:15.395738Z","updated":"2026-03-16T21:35:03.423723Z","approved":"2026-02-25T00:17:04.298159Z","queued":"2026-02-21T06:53:23.810707Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":14798,"followers":12,"categories":["technology"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["forge"],"versions":["V7PKrg8P","h8fUM6Bo","4HIDAXcq"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/da994ceab189aacc69955a4b6a4ac2499390f6d2_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/da994ceab189aacc69955a4b6a4ac2499390f6d2.jpeg","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.gg/R6dQxxRr","donation_urls":[{"id":"patreon","platform":"Patreon","url":"https://patreon.com/tijon"}],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/images/7ddce3e8398a9d949047b1ecbe2079ccf82c4ccd_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/images/7ddce3e8398a9d949047b1ecbe2079ccf82c4ccd.jpeg","featured":false,"title":"Art by Darkster","description":"Because Tac Z FINALLY got the Epic treatment!","created":"2026-02-21T06:44:33.521547Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/images/ac16a2216b49d39b3767707def71732f001b3018_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/images/ac16a2216b49d39b3767707def71732f001b3018.jpeg","featured":false,"title":"Front View","description":"View from the front of the pistol\'s idle animation","created":"2026-02-21T06:45:17.885387Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/images/49b8bde46781df69164e3763e98b65d291bd2261_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/TVje4pU2/images/49b8bde46781df69164e3763e98b65d291bd2261.jpeg","featured":false,"title":"Back View","description":"View from the back of the pistol\'s idle animation","created":"2026-02-21T06:45:30.171033Z","ordering":3}],"color":13981751,"thread_id":"q1dA7owy","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"wsGFwHuz","slug":"inve-tory","project_type":"mod","team":"uCF8kNUY","organization":null,"title":"Inve tory","description":"Hardcore Armor-Locked Inventory Mod","body":"\\n![title inve tory](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c604d3568085cfe33c3f579a12d5531bcbbdc5f3_0.webp)\\nYour inventory is locked! To unlock slots, you need to wear armor-the more expensive it is, the more slots you get.\\n\\n<hr>\\n\\n## Features\\n- Equip armor to gain slots, then manually activate them inside your inventory interface.\\n- Don\'t like the layout or want to change it? Click the new reset button to clear your active slots and reconfigure your inventory.\\n- Keep in mind: not all gear grants slots, and equipping an Elytra will completely lock them down!\\n- compatible with items in curios slots\\n\\n<hr>\\n\\n## Preset Config\\nThere is currently 5 presets which defines in which order slots will be opened\\n\\n- Custom -> you will manually open and close slots and next time they will automatically open in your order\\n- Horizontal -> slots will open from left to right, starting from the top row\\n- Horizontal reversed -> slots will open from right to left, starting from the bottom row\\n- Vertical -> slots will open from top to bottom, starting from the left column\\n- Vertical reversed -> slots will open from bottom to top, starting from the right column\\n\\n<hr>\\n\\n## Item Config\\nBy default 1.5 slots are given per armor attribute on an item, but can be changed in the config.\\n\\nits also possible to add a custom value to item using datapacks, in this case the armor attribute will be ignored.\\n\\nCreate a file `data/inve_tory/data_maps/item/slots.json` in your datapack, as an example we will give -8 slots to diamond helmet\\n```\\n{\\n  \\"values\\": {\\n    \\"minecraft:diamond_helmet\\": -8\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n","body_url":null,"published":"2026-09-30T20:44:18.952477Z","updated":"2026-10-05T14:49:31.199734Z","approved":"2026-10-05T20:34:02.512880Z","queued":"2026-10-05T14:52:39.404391Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":73,"followers":3,"categories":["storage"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["neoforge"],"versions":["QkBe9eVo"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wsGFwHuz/d5fab492d6170d667afacee7a93a43d32f3f66ae.gif","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wsGFwHuz/d5fab492d6170d667afacee7a93a43d32f3f66ae.gif","issues_url":"https://github.com/1foxy2/inve_tory/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/1foxy2/inve_tory","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.com/invite/GTYvTWfzxt","donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wsGFwHuz/images/03954fd7cd85e13acafc123c5309017fce7f1a03.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wsGFwHuz/images/03954fd7cd85e13acafc123c5309017fce7f1a03.png","featured":false,"title":"locked inventory","description":"A player inventory with locked slots","created":"2026-10-05T14:35:29.478888Z","ordering":0}],"color":9211020,"thread_id":"CbedpA7a","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21","1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"vjel2moU","slug":"mob-talisman","project_type":"mod","team":"iy8IduZO","organization":null,"title":"Mob Talisman","description":"This mod adds 48 powerful talisman that can give you the powers from several mobs.","body":"This mod adds new talismans that grant various powers from different mobs.\\n\\n# Features\\n### Talismans\\nThere are currently 48 unique talismans in the mod. Each one can be dropped by its corresponding mob.\\n\\nHere are a few examples of the more notable talismans. You can view all the talismans in the gallery. However keep in mind that some talismans have cooldowns that are not listed in the gallery.\\n\\n![Breeze Talisman](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9aa93426a373b7ec4a06547a26eabffa7b380e36_0.webp)\\n_This talisman gives you a windcharge boost when pressing a certain key._\\n\\n![Creeper Talisman](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d41540f75bf79232465d6ccaf4086d2b0ce9847f_0.webp)\\n_This talisman makes it so that Creepers fear players and no longer explode._\\n\\n![Shulker Talisman](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ae9d9eaa19bc04ea50f44480ea769c5112dfe3f_0.webp)\\n_This talisman gives you the ability to open Shulker Boxes from your hotbar without the need to place them._\\n\\n### Advancements\\nThere are currently 9 Advancements in the mod.\\n<details>\\n<summary>Advancement list</summary>\\n\\n1. Into Talisman - Obtain a talisman\\n2. Collector - Obtain every single talisman\\n3. I think a spider bit me - Sprint against a wall using the Spider Talisman\\n4. Definitely skill-based - Get a random item while using the Wither Talisman\\n5. Villager\'s Touch - Kill a mob while using the Villager Talisman\\n6. Home Sweet Home - Teleport back to your saved position using the Enderman Talisman\\n7. The tables have turned - Make a creeper run away from you using the Creeper Talisman\\n8. Ruminant - Eat grass by using the Sheep Talisman\\n9. Infinite Power - Reach Strength X by using the Ravager Talisman\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n### Configuration\\nYou can configure the drop chance for each talisman individually. Therefore you can freely decide which talismans should be disabled.\\n\\nThere are also 100+ configuration options for nearly every other value used in the mod. If you\'re still missing a configuration option, feel free to contact me on Discord (see below).\\n\\nNote that when playing in singleplayer, you need to rejoin the world for the config changes to take effect. In multiplayer, you need to restart the server.\\n\\n# Translations\\nThis mod has currently a translation for the following languages:\\n- English\\n- German\\n\\nIf you want to contribute any other language please contact me on Discord (see below).\\n\\n# Dependencies\\nThis mod requires the following other mods as dependencies:\\n- [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)\\n- [oωo (owo-lib)](https://modrinth.com/mod/owo-lib)\\n- [Cardinal Components API](https://modrinth.com/mod/cardinal-components-api)\\n- [Accessories](https://modrinth.com/mod/accessories)\\n\\nAlthough it is not required, [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) is highly recommended.\\n\\n# Support\\nIf you have questions, encounter problems, find bugs or have suggestions you can join my discord server:\\n\\n[![Fneifnox\'s Mods Discord Server](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d65d0cb3b474c0517d6d0e11b8f77c2276edf08f.png)](https://discord.gg/bszSDCq5ms)\\n","body_url":null,"published":"2025-05-31T11:11:21.081352Z","updated":"2025-07-30T15:11:47.380915Z","approved":"2025-07-17T12:48:27.806701Z","queued":"2025-07-03T16:20:58.220625Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-Fneifnoxs-License","name":"","url":"https://pastebin.com/E6MB5nZG"},"downloads":678,"followers":4,"categories":["adventure","equipment","mobs"],"additional_categories":["magic"],"loaders":["fabric"],"versions":["6O4B5Cio","Z5ruEJKQ","ntI1kpz5","RBksBGHr"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/dbecf3e5a4bb2a485c6cea13518c2ff6a601f0d5.png","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/dbecf3e5a4bb2a485c6cea13518c2ff6a601f0d5.png","issues_url":"https://github.com/Fneifnox/mob-talisman/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/Fneifnox/mob-talisman","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.gg/bszSDCq5ms","donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1a89f47146045e1068989a59430c1c8bf8b52131_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1a89f47146045e1068989a59430c1c8bf8b52131.png","featured":false,"title":"Allay Talisman","description":"Gain +250% collection range","created":"2025-07-01T15:15:12.358341Z","ordering":1},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/2834638afff45319f075a7594af7ce76b0c34973_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/2834638afff45319f075a7594af7ce76b0c34973.png","featured":false,"title":"Armadillo Talisman","description":"After taking damage, gain 5 seconds of Invincibility","created":"2025-07-01T15:18:47.152634Z","ordering":2},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/d3db3bce620f0b7259e5d998ef271c9c70497e79_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/d3db3bce620f0b7259e5d998ef271c9c70497e79.png","featured":false,"title":"Axolotl Talisman","description":"Gain Regeneration III while standing still","created":"2025-07-01T15:30:04.194031Z","ordering":3},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/95117b494f39145b51a7a0937274f63a23bdda75_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/95117b494f39145b51a7a0937274f63a23bdda75.png","featured":false,"title":"Bat Talisman","description":"Gain the ability to fly","created":"2025-07-01T15:30:19.779808Z","ordering":4},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/970eb2b7f3c0229836cd2cb01c581ce7a6a7f19b_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/970eb2b7f3c0229836cd2cb01c581ce7a6a7f19b.png","featured":false,"title":"Blaze Talisman","description":"Gain Fire Resistance","created":"2025-07-01T15:30:28.340076Z","ordering":5},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/9aa93426a373b7ec4a06547a26eabffa7b380e36_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/9aa93426a373b7ec4a06547a26eabffa7b380e36.png","featured":false,"title":"Breeze Talisman","description":"When pressing B, get a windcharge boost","created":"2025-07-01T15:31:55.911912Z","ordering":6},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/0964f5a0c917259864abe2fce48916e1713e7c10_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/0964f5a0c917259864abe2fce48916e1713e7c10.png","featured":false,"title":"Cat Talisman","description":"Gain +50% movement speed","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:03.123387Z","ordering":7},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/3adfaa007f44d84b671a9e9835145f036e558e46_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/3adfaa007f44d84b671a9e9835145f036e558e46.png","featured":false,"title":"Camel Talisman","description":"When pressing C, dash forward","created":"2025-07-13T16:07:32.650536Z","ordering":7},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/f2ee8dac0638391d6f44f38bc19b97316feb4924_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/f2ee8dac0638391d6f44f38bc19b97316feb4924.png","featured":false,"title":"Chicken Talisman","description":"Gain Slow Falling","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:10.512058Z","ordering":8},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/37036f40a8e08617f68332185f2f81f20d81349a_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/37036f40a8e08617f68332185f2f81f20d81349a.png","featured":false,"title":"Cow Talisman","description":"Gain immunity against all negative effects","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:19.100130Z","ordering":9},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/d41540f75bf79232465d6ccaf4086d2b0ce9847f_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/d41540f75bf79232465d6ccaf4086d2b0ce9847f.png","featured":false,"title":"Creeper Talisman","description":"Creepers fear players and no longer explode","created":"2025-07-14T15:15:21.498068Z","ordering":9},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1a066bc9162f83b36a12317a8343aaab04e1d40a_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1a066bc9162f83b36a12317a8343aaab04e1d40a.png","featured":false,"title":"Dolphin Talisman","description":"Gain Dolphins Grace","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:24.474170Z","ordering":10},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/410b4c8d06b60647f00ae7deec8dfd89618f56d8_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/410b4c8d06b60647f00ae7deec8dfd89618f56d8.png","featured":false,"title":"Donkey Talisman","description":"When pressing O, open a backpack","created":"2025-07-25T17:24:04.040416Z","ordering":10},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/8a1614967aa6b1d8569b80e54ea3a65f60d0cd51_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/8a1614967aa6b1d8569b80e54ea3a65f60d0cd51.png","featured":false,"title":"Drowned Talisman","description":"Gain +200% underwater breathing","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:28.436278Z","ordering":11},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/276f0f1d6ef641c222eba3c5ffd0a5f21cfd142e_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/276f0f1d6ef641c222eba3c5ffd0a5f21cfd142e.png","featured":false,"title":"Elder Guardian Talisman","description":"Get a sponge","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:33.422656Z","ordering":12},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/4afdbae688573425950ea8dad3316d02e7796ca0_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/4afdbae688573425950ea8dad3316d02e7796ca0.png","featured":false,"title":"Ender Dragon Talisman","description":"Gain a +50% increased chance to find a Talisman","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:38.217047Z","ordering":13},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/be9027ec2190e582897f936e32546a1c6db4a7ff_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/be9027ec2190e582897f936e32546a1c6db4a7ff.png","featured":false,"title":"Enderman Talisman","description":"Saves your current position, when unequipped teleports you to that position","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:43.080616Z","ordering":14},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/6756a032386f5f64c2b59a1faf1b3ea5b3654111_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/6756a032386f5f64c2b59a1faf1b3ea5b3654111.png","featured":false,"title":"Evoker Talisman","description":"Evokers now drop 2 Totems of Undying","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:48.146054Z","ordering":15},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1e95f657edcc0d9b9a937367b24bab0f65df2130_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1e95f657edcc0d9b9a937367b24bab0f65df2130.png","featured":false,"title":"Endermite Talisman","description":"Be able to open Enderchests by right clicking them in your hotbar","created":"2025-07-16T16:29:08.764950Z","ordering":15},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/557bb99f7176a2c07e65ddb2cd434626513b87d8_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/557bb99f7176a2c07e65ddb2cd434626513b87d8.png","featured":false,"title":"Ghast Talisman","description":"When pressing G, shoot a fireball","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:53.627697Z","ordering":16},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1192fbf993c341f1533de603fc12ccfc03439558_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/1192fbf993c341f1533de603fc12ccfc03439558.png","featured":false,"title":"Glow Squid Talisman","description":"Every item now glows\\nor... [changeable via config]\\nEvery entity now glows (including you)","created":"2025-07-01T15:32:59.245786Z","ordering":17},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/ce9055bfdf9ad0676c72718814d41e222992c34b_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/ce9055bfdf9ad0676c72718814d41e222992c34b.png","featured":false,"title":"Guardian Talisman","description":"Get either Prismarine, Dark Prismarine, Prismarine Bricks or Sea Lanterns","created":"2025-07-01T15:33:04.772709Z","ordering":18},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/e56eafbf35ec0869949f28173fa25a21e67454d8_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/e56eafbf35ec0869949f28173fa25a21e67454d8.png","featured":false,"title":"Horse Talisman","description":"Gain +1 Step Height","created":"2025-07-01T15:33:10.435603Z","ordering":19},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel2moU/images/c8e6767a6bdf6f19873c619990577de87bb23534_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vjel