,"raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/dc366ae2791eab20e49ba0ebad397caa7d10bd81.png","featured":false,"title":"Diffuser Recipe","description":null,"created":"2026-02-16T18:12:42.487360Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/dd17f8d4ba24079fb4cc0979af9e1e92cd1974c8_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/dd17f8d4ba24079fb4cc0979af9e1e92cd1974c8.png","featured":false,"title":"Fermented Phantom Membrane","description":null,"created":"2026-02-16T18:12:54.820017Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/ad140888135b376727e32ebe2f8164df5daf04af_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/ad140888135b376727e32ebe2f8164df5daf04af.png","featured":false,"title":"Sea Compost Recipe","description":null,"created":"2026-02-16T18:13:06.722873Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/4470c0f0db2b52ce4e2bc233ce721d1ec93d92f7.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/4470c0f0db2b52ce4e2bc233ce721d1ec93d92f7.png","featured":false,"title":"Undying Upgrade","description":null,"created":"2026-02-16T18:13:16.995761Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/3928b2dbba14c854b9e12532051e6f5d51e07ee2.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RIVSZ9Ee/images/3928b2dbba14c854b9e12532051e6f5d51e07ee2.png","featured":false,"title":"Radiant Upgrade","description":null,"created":"2026-02-16T18:13:27.037509Z","ordering":0}],"color":2303294,"thread_id":"fDMB2oBM","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"avg0meWZ","slug":"pantograph","project_type":"mod","team":"IoypErFM","organization":null,"title":"Pantograph","description":"Adds a new tool to Minecraft; the Pantograph!","body":"## TL;DR\\nQuickly build things at twice the size using the [Pantograph](https://wikipedia.com/wiki/Pantograph)! Comes in each of the vanilla tiers, with varying maximum range based on tier.\\n\\n## Demo\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/y5X2ZxCQaJM\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n\\n## Ranges\\nWood: 8 Blocks  \\nStone: 16 Blocks  \\nIron: 48 Blocks  \\nGold: 64 Blocks  \\nDiamond & Netherite: 128 Blocks  \\n\\n## Compatibility\\nDesigned to run on Fabric & NeoForge 1.21.1, requires Architectury API.","body_url":null,"published":"2026-07-23T22:09:22.690971Z","updated":"2026-07-23T22:19:51.253336Z","approved":"2026-07-27T18:54:03.465141Z","queued":"2026-07-23T22:22:02.348689Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-WTFPL","name":"","url":"https://www.wtfpl.net/about/"},"downloads":117,"followers":2,"categories":["utility"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["fabric","neoforge"],"versions":["gqrlMLv2","WQ60Sdut"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/avg0meWZ/17d03b5ea115a923383da2ef3ecec3e3e558e077.png","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/avg0meWZ/17d03b5ea115a923383da2ef3ecec3e3e558e077.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[],"color":3745295,"thread_id":"U9Qjclfp","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","game_versions":["1.20.1","1.21.1","1.21.11","1.21.5","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2"],"environment":[],"id":"7pnaPyJe","slug":"charmsy","project_type":"resourcepack","team":"hpaVhQs4","organization":null,"title":"Charmsy x Punchy!","description":"Adds physics based charms to Minecraft items using Punchy! mod, bringing extra personality and movement while staying true to the vanilla style.","body":"![banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/71d98b49d39120cac62abac8f51db55a5e7c1e62.png)\\n  <br>\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n<img\\n  align=\\"center\\"\\n  width=\\"400px\\"\\n  src=\\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e7cb1806814e6f71d1c2acb19b06fd8e11bbfed6.png\\"\\n  alt=\\"Logo\\">\\n</div>\\n  <br>\\n\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n<h3>Small charms, big personality.</h3>\\n  <b>Charmsy<b> is a vanilla friendly resource pack created for <b>Punchy Animations First Person<b> that adds physics based charms to Minecraft items.\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n<h3>Features</h3>\\n</div>\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\nThis pack adds physics based charms to your first person items, designed specifically for Punchy Animations First Person while maintaining a vanilla friendly art style. Each tool and weapon features its own unique charm, bringing extra personality and detail to your equipment. Lightweight and immersive, the pack enhances item customization without affecting gameplay, making every item feel more alive than ever.\\n</div>\\n<br>\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\nWhether you\'re exploring caves, fighting mobs, or building your next project, your items will feel more alive than ever.\\n</div>\\n<br>\\n<br>\\n\\n![names](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/412afdfed0331f314998834b38ee09c93f1bbf9d_0.webp)\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\">  \\n<b>To use a charm, simply rename your sword or spear in an anvil to match one of the available names listed in the table above. Once renamed, the corresponding charm will automatically appear on your weapon.</b>\\n</div>\\n<br>\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n<a href=\\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\\">\\n<img width=\\"30%\\" src=\\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/35e17bcff24fe173bf6cdab93344da8318299293_0.webp\\">\\n</a>\\n</div>\\n<br>\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n<h3>Charmsy Initial Roadmap</h3>\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n| Item | Status | Charms |\\n|----------|----------|----------|\\n| Swords | Available | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Spears | Available | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Tridents | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Pickaxes | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Axes | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Shovels | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Hoes | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Bows | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Crossbows | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |\\n| Fishing Rods | Planned | Allay, Axolotl, Bee, Camel, Chicken, Creeper, Pufferfish, Warden, Zombie |","body_url":null,"published":"2026-06-24T14:20:00.554894Z","updated":"2026-06-27T20:07:13.406251Z","approved":"2026-06-25T04:34:17.811421Z","queued":"2026-06-24T19:02:36.669373Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":26298,"followers":74,"categories":["decoration","equipment","vanilla-like"],"additional_categories":["16x","items","modded","models","simplistic"],"loaders":["minecraft"],"versions":["AYwmKVhE"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/7pnaPyJe/5c13199ca9316077daf8fb50d9b0b98bde76823f.gif","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/7pnaPyJe/5c13199ca9316077daf8fb50d9b0b98bde76823f.gif","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/7pnaPyJe/images/586a577f447816cbf595417a61753b3b6fb40779.gif","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/7pnaPyJe/images/586a577f447816cbf595417a61753b3b6fb40779.gif","featured":true,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-06-24T18:02:15.249423Z","ordering":0}],"color":13333508,"thread_id":"uWYRwYoh","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"optional","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.16","1.17","1.17.1","1.20","1.20.1","1.21.10","1.21.11","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"environment":[],"id":"FZQunV3q","slug":"lockdown","project_type":"mod","team":"RFlmQg7y","organization":null,"title":"Lockdown","description":"From laser turrets to force fields, Lockdown adds security-themed blocks/items to secure your base against intruders!","body":"From laser turrets to force fields, Lockdown adds security-themed blocks/items to secure your base against intruders!\\n\\n![Preview image showing a drone, turrets, lasers, and alarms](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/831d885e6f7adafd05143e22564cd1a21426645c.png)\\n\\nA more complete wiki is available [here](https://redstonetesseracted.github.io/Lockdown-Wiki/)\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Features\\n\\n## Security\\n\\n**Encoding Station**: Assigns a code to any encodable device.  The device of choice is placed in the top slot, while three dye representing the code go in the bottom row.\\n\\n**Keycard reader**: Emits a redstone signal when any player within five blocks holds a keycard with the same code as itself.  Assign a code/channel using the Encoding Station.\\n\\n**Laser Projector**: When powered, it emits a short-range laser that damages mobs that touch it.\\n\\n**Alarm Lights**: Emits a rotating glow when it detects a wireless signal from a device on the same channel.  Assign a channel using the Encoding Station.\\n\\n**Klaxon**: Plays an alarm sound-effect when powered.  Right click the block to cycle between available alarms.\\n\\n**Force Field Projector**: Projects an indestructible force field when powered.  Right click the block to cycle between different force field sizes, ranging from 1x1 to 5x5.\\n\\n\\n## Defense\\n\\n**Defense Turret**: Fires a laser beam at any hostile mob it detects within range.  Will not attack players by default.  However, when assigned a code, it will attack any player whose last held keycard does not match.  Optionally assign a code using the Encoding Station.\\n\\n**Defense Drone**: Patrols the surrounding area and attacks any hostile mobs it finds using its laser beam.  Will not attack players by default.  However, when assigned a code, it will attack any unrecognized player whose last held keycard does not match.  Optionally assign a code using the Encoding Station.\\n\\n**Air Defense Cannon**: A large, player-controllable cannon that fires bolts of energy.\\n\\n\\n## Upgrades\\n\\n**Durability Upgrade**: Increases the health of a drone or turret.\\n\\n**Flamethrower Upgrade**: Allows drones to shoot fireballs and turrets to shoot bolts of fire instead of lasers.\\n\\n**Range Upgrade**: Increases the effective range of a drone or turret.\\n\\n**Suspicious Thumb Drive**: Causes drones and turrets to attack players and friendly mobs.  Found in abandoned bunkers.\\n\\n\\n## Tools\\n\\n**Key**: Allows you to lock containers.  Add a unique code in the encoder, then shift + right-click on a container to add or remove the lock.\\n\\n**Laser Blaster**: A ranged weapon that fires lasers at your enemies.  Be careful not to let it overheat!\\n\\n**Redstone Energy Cell**: Fuel for the laster blaster.\\n\\n**Spray Can**: Applies colors to turrets, drones, and cannons.  Right-click in main-hand to apply primary color, and right-click in off-hand to apply secondary color.  Cycle between colors with sneak + right-click.\\n\\n\\n## Redstone\\n\\n**Wireless Transmitter**: When powered, it outputs a wireless signal to any receiver on the same channel.  Assign a channel using the Encoding Station.\\n\\n**Wireless Receiver**: Outputs a redstone signal when it detects a wireless signal from a device on the same channel.  Assign a channel using the Encoding Station.\\n\\n**Player Detector**: Outputs a redstone signal when it detects a player within a five-block radius.\\n\\n**Mob Detector**: Outputs a redstone signal when it detects a mob within a five-block radius.\\n\\n**Big Buttons**: Similar to a regular button, except more imposing!  Can optionally be assigned a channel to broadcast to using the Encoding Station.\\n\\n\\n## Structures\\n\\n**Abandoned Bunker**: An uncommon, partially-buried structure abandoned by an unknown faction.  Whoever built them is long gone, but the defenses they left behind sure aren\'t!\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Cheats\\n\\nYou can give yourself all blocks/items in the data pack with the following commands:\\n\\n```\\n# R3 and Beyond\\n/loot give @s loot lockdown:cheat/alarms\\n/loot give @s loot lockdown:cheat/buttons\\n/loot give @s loot lockdown:cheat/keycards\\n/loot give @s loot lockdown:cheat/machines\\n/loot give @s loot lockdown:cheat/tools\\n/loot give @s loot lockdown:cheat/upgrades\\n\\n# R2 and Prior\\n/function lockdown:give/alarms\\n/function lockdown:give/blocks\\n/function lockdown:give/buttons\\n/function lockdown:give/devices\\n/function lockdown:give/upgrades\\n```\\n","body_url":null,"published":"2025-11-06T01:57:02.645874Z","updated":"2026-10-11T23:20:46.868417Z","approved":"2025-11-06T06:14:31.778023Z","queued":"2025-11-06T03:03:27.269317Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":1866,"followers":10,"categories":["technology","utility"],"additional_categories":["game-mechanics","mobs"],"loaders":["datapack"],"versions":["aX3pucGQ","eUYfRGdk","vVBfwJ74","LmuJH7ne","yTvQeocK","UP3H6KCE","xBm1b3J6","XYeUscT9","jKlTd15Y","kg6MBPMg","6bGNN0iL"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/49f8127a105dbc1d8441ddb159091066c932e862_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/49f8127a105dbc1d8441ddb159091066c932e862.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":"https://github.com/RedstoneTesseracted/Lockdown","wiki_url":"https://redstonetesseracted.github.io/Lockdown-Wiki/","discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/6b4087c7c5f7b2475e0c61a86bc7f57dff15f1e5_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/6b4087c7c5f7b2475e0c61a86bc7f57dff15f1e5.png","featured":false,"title":"Decorative Buttons","description":null,"created":"2025-11-06T01:58:52.651949Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/7bd13473fd8cce30ccf592c288616688d6df33e0_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/7bd13473fd8cce30ccf592c288616688d6df33e0.png","featured":false,"title":"Defense Drone","description":null,"created":"2025-11-06T01:59:06.595120Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/cbff808a6130f9cfa3c8c3a0ecdfea30c85f14e6_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/cbff808a6130f9cfa3c8c3a0ecdfea30c85f14e6.png","featured":false,"title":"Wireless Redstone","description":null,"created":"2025-11-06T01:59:17.740111Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/75a4be33ea413f444c6fccd5f756f79b20a16764_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/75a4be33ea413f444c6fccd5f756f79b20a16764.png","featured":false,"title":"Encoding Station","description":null,"created":"2025-11-06T01:59:27.138808Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/a438953cd0947c0e4ced3e8691343100ed12d26c_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/a438953cd0947c0e4ced3e8691343100ed12d26c.png","featured":false,"title":"Force Fields","description":null,"created":"2025-11-06T01:59:38.598127Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/831d885e6f7adafd05143e22564cd1a21426645c_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/831d885e6f7adafd05143e22564cd1a21426645c.png","featured":true,"title":"Lockdown","description":null,"created":"2025-11-06T02:49:17.025546Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/21e3d7ce89fb488a3206aa7dd7e5cad70d00907f_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/21e3d7ce89fb488a3206aa7dd7e5cad70d00907f.png","featured":false,"title":"All Devices","description":null,"created":"2026-10-11T22:21:14.664355Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/e154eea58dc6688c49c7152b0c8c756e109cef72_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/e154eea58dc6688c49c7152b0c8c756e109cef72.png","featured":false,"title":"Air Defense Cannon","description":null,"created":"2026-10-11T22:21:34.103426Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/7a39a20f1cf9653b5ca436da1ca2ea680822e059_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FZQunV3q/images/7a39a20f1cf9653b5ca436da1ca2ea680822e059.png","featured":false,"title":"Abandoned Bunker","description":null,"created":"2026-10-11T22:21:44.541625Z","ordering":0}],"color":8416098,"thread_id":"AFTKjSsF","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"W1ZUfWdr","slug":"create-coasters-simulated","project_type":"mod","team":"bloRbBqo","organization":null,"title":"Create: Coasters Simulated","description":"Build real rollercoasters with physics, loops, and jumps in this add-on for the Create mod!","body":"<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2f3qT1UxPh8\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n\\n\\n## About\\n\\nBuild thrilling coasters with loops, inversions, and even jumps using a new set of blocks and items from this Create mod add-on! Simulate real roller coaster physics with chain lifts to bring your carts up and gravity that does the rest.\\n\\n\\n## Compatibility\\n\\nThis mod uses Sable, a physics library developed by the team behind Create: Aeronautics. This mod does not require Create: Aeronautics to be installed, but is built to be highly compatible with the mechanisms added by Simulated, Aeronautics, Offroad, and its other add-ons.\\n\\n\\n## Existing Features\\n\\n- Roller Coaster Tracks / Track Anchorpoint Blocks\\n- Support for loops, inversions, chain lifts, and jumps\\n- Dyable tracks\\n- Carts / Cart Linking\\n- Rivets that hold sublevels together\\n- Balloons as a utility for moving assembled contraptions\\n  \\n## Planned Features\\n\\n- Hydraulic launches\\n- Coaster stations\\n- More colors for balloons\\n- 2 wide cart bogeys\\n\\n\\n## !! Early Bird Warning !!\\n\\nWe believe the mod has reached a fairly stable state suitable for release. But, for the first few weeks after release expect bugs and performance issues that may have slipped through the cracks of development. If you find any issues, please immediately report them to my discord server.","body_url":null,"published":"2026-07-29T03:25:25.418059Z","updated":"2026-08-15T16:55:18.891247Z","approved":"2026-07-31T16:35:35.395242Z","queued":"2026-07-29T05:00:41.659388Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"private","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":406141,"followers":474,"categories":["game-mechanics","technology","transportation"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["neoforge"],"versions":["IXr3Jch9","iOm9m3BL","WtNrH6lS","CUlWYAXX","RIBBfVi3","PGhQoSBq"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/6df7487798dd29205aef6a6b4d07b5e3bb0b736a_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/6df7487798dd29205aef6a6b4d07b5e3bb0b736a.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.gg/7a3PcW9y5t","donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/images/83b5e6c4bf6c933f2b90d5419f8cd8dbaee1165a_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/images/83b5e6c4bf6c933f2b90d5419f8cd8dbaee1165a.png","featured":false,"title":"Pig Coaster","description":null,"created":"2026-07-29T04:41:07.875150Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/images/d1e0ed779a9e0d2708e403036ed11e5bd5ab8552_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/images/d1e0ed779a9e0d2708e403036ed11e5bd5ab8552.png","featured":false,"title":"Theme Park","description":null,"created":"2026-07-29T04:41:45.429289Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/images/ae7ae53d7a93e62c7cfb4e2d2aae753f06e104f0_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1ZUfWdr/images/ae7ae53d7a93e62c7cfb4e2d2aae753f06e104f0.png","featured":false,"title":"Twisty Tracks","description":null,"created":"2026-07-29T04:42:21.996504Z","ordering":0}],"color":8829154,"thread_id":"JlV6f6Yt","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["client_only"],"id":"IGVW2rb4","slug":"tidybinds","project_type":"mod","team":"A11AyjWi","organization":null,"title":"Tidy Binds","description":"Combine keybinds, hide keybinds, override keybinds, move keybinds between categories, reorder the categories, and much more.","body":"### 📌 about\\n**Tidy Binds** is a highly configurable utility primarily designed for modpack developers. It allows you to easily clean up the mess and clutter in the controls menu, as well as better integrate keybinds from mods into the game.\\n\\n### 🛠️ features\\n- **key overrides:** Redefine default keybinds so that pressing Reset restores your preferred defaults.\\n- **key combinations:** Trigger multiple actions with a single key by linking them together.\\n- **category management:** Move any keybind into a different category, including custom ones you define yourself.\\n- **category ordering:** Control exactly where each category appears in the list by assigning custom sort indices.\\n- **key hiding:** Hide unwanted keybinds to reduce clutter.\\n- **key unbinding:** Unbind hidden keys to prevent them from conflicting with existing ones.\\n- **entry spacing:** Add pixel padding between list entries for a cleaner look.\\n- **conflict suppression:** Disable the red highlighting on actions that share the same key.\\n- **debug tools:** Print all available key and category names to the log, or reveal hidden keys in a special category for troubleshooting.\\n- **in-game configuration:** Every feature can be toggled via the config screen to fit your specific playstyle.\\n\\n##### Found a bug? Please open an issue on [GitHub](https://github.com/aaavein/tidybinds/issues).","body_url":null,"published":"2025-12-06T15:32:26.462627Z","updated":"2025-12-13T18:03:24.559477Z","approved":"2025-12-08T06:04:18.615205Z","queued":"2025-12-06T21:52:53.237755Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MPL-2.0","name":"Mozilla Public License 2.0","url":null},"downloads":3367,"followers":10,"categories":["decoration","utility"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["neoforge"],"versions":["zlt536QY","swpFDv4S","6J8Po8Pz"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IGVW2rb4/2bb53ba7a26caa3d96d2a829ecf4cdb59a2ca63c_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IGVW2rb4/2bb53ba7a26caa3d96d2a829ecf4cdb59a2ca63c.png","issues_url":"https://github.com/aaavein/tidybinds/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/aaavein/tidybinds","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.gg/QRmQwvwvnx","donation_urls":[],"gallery":[],"color":9831574,"thread_id":"YQi6l0ja","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"XKKdG4wS","slug":"retro-mario-worlds","project_type":"mod","team":"OfRKg4BD","organization":null,"title":"Retro Mario Worlds ( Super Mario Bros 3 Edition )","description":"Biomes, enemies, and power-ups from old Super Mario games in Minecraft","body":"Retro Mario Worlds is a mod that recreates the worlds of the retro games in the Super Mario series, adding biomes, enemies, blocks, and power-ups.\\n\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/QF6wLC1YZaU\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n\\nThis mod adds:\\n\\n- 8 Worlds and Structures\\n![Grasslands](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f66f5f4c14d39fa2c39076b10c5ada9108497d58.png)\\n- ![World 1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b741928fcbd62c791fa87b3f099b0d15296ccc43.png)\\n- ![Brothers House](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a76ae1bb90d99056e813b174f2a62014827b46ef.png)\\n- ![Airship](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1d8c6030a3be3d37b31b0c06364d9b0aa59eefff_0.webp)\\n- Variety of enemies and Bosses\\n- ![Koopas](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/90acd3f019b00610b4d5864bd8ff1f45dde0eb1c.png)\\n- 8 power-ups and tools\\n- ![Power Ups](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/150608d1f9c5125a24683a60fd6d21e8d99f71ff.png)\\n- Warp Whistle It transports you to the world of Super Mario Bros. 3\\n- ![warpwhistle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c53a889c510924cf9c072c788414065e3428033a.png)\\n- Return Whistle Returns you to the overworld\\n- ![returnwhistle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/336eec0e249f4a6d8e5633525e2cecb886895459.png)\\n- Pipe Linker works to connect two teleportation pipes\\n- ![pipe linker](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b046798dbdd7d8c1b3913f90588203755b1be7e0.png)\\n- A Variety of standard, functional, and decorative blocks\\n- ![functional blocks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/674db3517c8112a8f16a2ff19c5589f60c5fa133.png)\\n-![functional blocks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6950ded6518e8bd5296b3d31df0ef3ae096251b0.png)\\n\\n- Special Keys\\n- **_Some power-ups have an additional effect when you crouch and press the power-up button._**\\n- ![Power up Key](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8b7e9cc423b4e8b0781621c0385272f94d1616eb_0.webp)\\n- ![Tail Swing](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e33b3ab6ce34093bbc2edcd6c07041d0b7ddd260_0.webp)\\n  \\n\\n\\n- This mod is made out of love for the classic Super Mario games. The textures and sounds are generally the property of Nintendo; I am only recreating them in Minecraft.\\n\\n\\n\\n- The mod may have bugs or errors that I will fix as I update it.\\n\\n- This mod requires the following mods to function properly: Geckolib, Kleiders Custom Renderer API and Fusion (Connected Textures)\\n\\nHere are the direct links: \\n\\n[Fusion Mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/fusion-connected-textures/version/1.2.7b-forge-mc1.20.1)\\n\\n[Geckolib Mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib/version/4.2.1)\\n\\n[Kleiders Custom Renderer API](https://modrinth.com/mod/kleiders-custom-renderer-api/version/7.4.1)\\n","body_url":null,"published":"2025-08-15T01:48:48.101451Z","updated":"2026-10-14T22:26:09.635244Z","approved":"2025-08-20T01:24:42.946163Z","queued":"2025-08-15T02:19:27.517159Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":2651,"followers":22,"categories":["adventure","mobs","worldgen"],"additional_categories":["decoration","equipment"],"loaders":["forge"],"versions":["hUDmdh5s","9XBcIk2K","l91s729j"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XKKdG4wS/6a372dd0628ac817af10f0064af563c1d4d1884c_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XKKdG4wS/6a372dd0628ac817af10f0064af563c1d4d1884c.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[],"color":9603249,"thread_id":"aX96dVCZ","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20.1","1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"i2yo1LYg","slug":"velthoric","project_type":"mod","team":"dLPjP7XG","organization":null,"title":"Velthoric","description":"Adds high-performance physics to Minecraft","body":"<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img src=\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/refs/heads/master/assets/velthoric_icon_rounded_corners.png\\" alt=\\"Velthoric Icon\\" width=\\"128\\" height=\\"128\\">\\n</p>\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n  <h1>Velthoric</h1>\\n  <p>Redefining physics in the world of Minecraft.</p>\\n</div>\\n\\n<p align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img src=\\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environment-Client%20%26%20Server-033da8?style=flat-square\\" alt=\\"Environment\\">\\n  &nbsp;\\n  <a href=\\"https://cloudsmith.io/~velthoric/repos/velthoric/packages/\\">\\n    <img src=\\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Hosted_by-Cloudsmith-033da8?style=flat-square&logo=cloudsmith&logoColor=white\\" alt=\\"Hosted by Cloudsmith\\">\\n  </a>\\n</p>\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\" style=\\"display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\\">\\n  <a href=\\"https://fabricmc.net/\\"><img src=\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/refs/heads/master/assets/fabric_badge.png\\" alt=\\"Fabric\\"></a>\\n  <a href=\\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/\\"><img src=\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/refs/heads/master/assets/forge_badge.png\\" alt=\\"Forge\\"></a>\\n  <a href=\\"https://neoforged.net/\\"><img src=\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/refs/heads/master/assets/neoforge_badge.png\\" alt=\\"NeoForge\\"></a>\\n  <a href=\\"https://quiltmc.org/\\"><img src=\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/refs/heads/master/assets/quilt_badge.png\\" alt=\\"Quilt\\"></a>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\" style=\\"margin-bottom: 24px;\\">\\n  <a href=\\"https://docs.architectury.dev/api/introduction/\\">\\n    <img src=\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/refs/heads/master/assets/architectury_api_badge.png\\" alt=\\"Architectury API\\">\\n  </a>\\n</div>\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 👋 Welcome to Velthoric\\n\\nVelthoric is a project dedicated to bringing advanced, high-performance physics to Minecraft.\\n\\n**Important Note:** Right now, this mod is a **Proof of Concept**. This means we are currently testing what’s possible and building the foundation. It is a work in progress, but it won\'t stay this way forever. We have big plans to turn this into a fully-fledged, stable physics engine for the community.\\n\\n### 💥 What makes this mod special?\\nWe aren\'t just adding simple animations. Velthoric integrates the professional Jolt Physics engine (via JoltJNI) directly into Minecraft. This allows for interactions that feel heavy, realistic, and incredibly smooth.\\n\\n**Current Features:**\\n*   **True Rigid and Soft Bodies:** Interact with solid objects, or play with deformable things like cloth and ropes.\\n*   **Working Vehicles:** Drive cars and motorcycles that feature actual suspension and wheel physics.\\n*   **Realistic Ragdolls:** Watch living entities react to the world with physical skeletal systems.\\n*   **Buoyancy:** Objects actually float in water and lava based on their weight and shape.\\n*   **World Interaction:** Convert standard blocks into dynamic physics objects that fall and collide.\\n*   **Optimized Performance:** Built using a \\"Structure of Arrays\\" (SoA) architecture to handle thousands of objects without killing your frame rate.\\n*   **Persistence:** Everything stays where it is. Physics bodies are saved with your world and synced perfectly between the server and the client.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 🎮 How to play with it\\nYou can test the engine right now using these commands:\\n\\n*   **`/vxsummon`**: Spawn objects like boxes, ropes, or marbles.\\n    *   Try this to test a vehicle: `/vxsummon velthoric:car ~ ~ ~` (Use **F3 + B** to see where to sit).\\n*   **`/vxtest`**: A quick way to spawn debug setups like chain grids or soft bodies.\\n*   **`/vxkill`**: Use this to clean up. You can target specific types of objects or everything nearby.\\n    *   Example: `/vxkill @x[type=velthoric:box,limit=5,sort=nearest]`\\n\\n### 🔧 Tools included\\nWe’ve added several tools to help you manipulate the world:\\n*   **PhysicsGun:** Grab, move, and throw objects around.\\n*   **Magnetizer:** Push or pull things with magnetic force.\\n*   **Launchers:** Special tools to shoot boxes or ragdolls into the air.\\n*   **ChainCreator:** Link objects together or anchor them to the ground.\\n\\n**Hint:** You can press **TAB** while holding any tool to open a menu and tweak settings like strength and range.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 💻 Supported Platforms\\nBecause Velthoric relies on native code for the physics engine, it currently supports:\\n*   Windows (x86_64)\\n*   Linux (x86_64 and Arm64)\\n*   MacOS (x86_64 and Arm64)\\n\\n**Warning:** Any other platforms, such as 32-bit systems or Android, are not supported and will result in a crash.\\n\\n### ⚠️ Feedback and Bug Reports\\nIf you find a bug or a compatibility issue, please let us know on the issue tracker:\\n\\n<a href=\\"https://github.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/issues\\">\\n  <img src=\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xI-Mx-Ix/Velthoric/refs/heads/master/assets/issues_badge.png\\" alt=\\"GitHub Issues\\">\\n</a>\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 🙏 Acknowledgments\\nThis project wouldn\'t be possible without these amazing resources:\\n*   [JoltJNI](https://github.com/stephengold/jolt-jni): The JNI bindings for Jolt Physics.\\n*   [Jolt Physics](https://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics): The powerful engine behind it all.","body_url":null,"published":"2025-09-13T10:05:14.072054Z","updated":"2026-07-13T16:23:46.467369Z","approved":"2025-09-15T02:46:30.529003Z","queued":"2025-09-13T12:09:48.936417Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LGPL-3.0-only","name":"GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only","url":null},"downloads":12676,"followers":102,"categories":["game-mechanics","library","utility"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt"],"versions":["6huJvygG","kqIk40Nm","B3gDoBB0","ZCNMAVSX","KUC2KR9J","A2wsgCcJ","E50D75bO","dklaYHKL","8yeRUoaO","L0ki3VyF","IJ2KFDBI","gKAcd7RU","J5xJTl95","kHWlDejF","e5ZubWvT","DEf93AeX","P7odF0XW","7Msjk4ZH","VxPpKsTq","gsL7wMn7","mSCgabBg","N2SufnRo","QD64RUtI","rSwfN1lJ","GONQqIll","IAn95RlO","qudDtfc5","KUvU3Qr9","XQjMgPDH","jWuLY7P4","nz3WqHl3","88PlnrMM","Eg5zNmre","eSDaKstS","iQ09PB5D","KNbd8Lw9","vwLe5FDg","ViG6Axvr"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/707cad56fa284d8360b6eeb9e34d75e813620218_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/707cad56fa284d8360b6eeb9e34d75e813620218.png","issues_url":"https://github.com/velthoric/Velthoric/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/velthoric/Velthoric","wiki_url":"https://velthoric.github.io/velthoric-docs","discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/a4dc59bceac15f056ab5b9c1adc6779fcc278522_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/a4dc59bceac15f056ab5b9c1adc6779fcc278522.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2025-09-13T12:08:28.109001Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/3d11b672893443876516d97e6f47cd7f338b95e5_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/3d11b672893443876516d97e6f47cd7f338b95e5.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2025-09-13T12:08:47.049922Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/1138a124865c9a1c03cd8efed86c340ca0201481_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/1138a124865c9a1c03cd8efed86c340ca0201481.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2025-09-15T17:59:50.888701Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/9940e81d5e79cf37619d5cd4b8f2ccfcbe249437_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/9940e81d5e79cf37619d5cd4b8f2ccfcbe249437.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2025-10-16T05:11:16.716579Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/2890475df92589d121c806af3af6d324e9f5dc63_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/2890475df92589d121c806af3af6d324e9f5dc63.png","featured":true,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-04-16T15:13:33.515266Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/b1dc748c2cca190cac052c90e5220791fa301905_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/i2yo1LYg/images/b1dc748c2cca190cac052c90e5220791fa301905.png","featured":false,"title":"Ingame Scene","description":"13.000 Bodies","created":"2026-09-18T14:18:06.787759Z","ordering":1}],"color":16540164,"thread_id":"NS6OzOca","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"zhIupQBu","slug":"luckyowls-wardrobe","project_type":"mod","team":"3IvnwYbj","organization":null,"title":"Lucky\'s Wardrobe","description":"A mod that adds functional cosmetic clothes into the game","body":"![Cover](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/73c2dc85d57e79f75d7b2fe0a2e01e279c49cc9e.png)![2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f027902344b2c872204514d43d79e51b79646fd0_0.webp)![3](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bdb361ba6170b006cf60305356e65507d030081c_0.webp)![4](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ba874b9d3e7cee56ee6285abc2b667fa4cf13a1d_0.webp)![5](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f813f1a576b5ef8972a18cc7b70c64026ad2d29c.png)![6](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9c0bc3a225f3c0a4655cbe81d6ff766fdcb4064.png)\\n\\nTranslation:\\n\\nWardrobe is a mod that aims to expand upon personality and immersion in Minecraft. The mod adds tons of new cosmetic items that are not only for looks but also have functionality. From winter coats and scarves that protect you from cold environments (Tough as Nails), different backpacks for extra storage options, even some accessory items that emit light to help see in the dark, much much more!!!","body_url":null,"published":"2025-05-08T20:49:43.111087Z","updated":"2025-06-18T02:25:17.974628Z","approved":"2025-06-24T06:48:20.529030Z","queued":"2025-06-18T02:25:41.325289Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":41650,"followers":140,"categories":["equipment"],"additional_categories":["adventure"],"loaders":["neoforge"],"versions":["nkAh4uc7"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/e056f951f89ec5f031e90d90bfd58452665dc9e3.gif","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/e056f951f89ec5f031e90d90bfd58452665dc9e3.gif","issues_url":"https://github.com/LuckyOwlStudios/luckys-wardrobe/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/LuckyOwlStudios/luckys-wardrobe","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://discord.gg/Hk8PdBRsrp","donation_urls":[{"id":"ko-fi","platform":"Ko-fi","url":"https://ko-fi.com/luckyowlstudios"}],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/b7c6f1c6fab1e92a5bd7508a76c48b36e78a51fa_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/b7c6f1c6fab1e92a5bd7508a76c48b36e78a51fa.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2025-05-08T21:51:27.865201Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/b7dd5bdf46f770df77d196674e0b1ba5441bfcf2_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/b7dd5bdf46f770df77d196674e0b1ba5441bfcf2.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2025-05-08T21:53:25.389786Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/10809b0b25ba79cffe4335018aae343a883cf1eb_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/10809b0b25ba79cffe4335018aae343a883cf1eb.png","featured":false,"title":"Hat On a Desk","description":null,"created":"2025-05-08T21:55:16.781462Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/8920c8ffa4d6bef04f0d76b78569e95739f6a057_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/8920c8ffa4d6bef04f0d76b78569e95739f6a057.png","featured":false,"title":"Snowy Fox Hat","description":null,"created":"2025-05-08T21:55:57.180165Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/2464eec329c1ed62e7c1647b453af808f8699b26_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/2464eec329c1ed62e7c1647b453af808f8699b26.png","featured":false,"title":"Worker Aprons","description":null,"created":"2025-05-08T21:57:07.688155Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/dd1b1cee2ebca8128af4f2ae2235653c7b836c08_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zhIupQBu/images/dd1b1cee2ebca8128af4f2ae2235653c7b836c08.png","featured":false,"title":"Lost Hat","description":"Obtain lost cosmetic items through adventuring in your world!","created":"2025-05-08T21:58:25.745139Z","ordering":0}],"color":5060909,"thread_id":"pJuBFzXk","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"1Ey816bd","slug":"abundant-delight","project_type":"mod","team":"sT9Hiz8H","organization":null,"title":"Abundant Delight","description":"Adds new dishes that combine two mods: Abundant Atmosphere and Farmer\'s Delight.","body":"![Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/07f4f9628145173a6641bc05e72df4f517a0027a_0.webp)\\nThis add-on was created to extend compatibility between Farmer\'s Delight and Abundant Atmosphere.\\nThere isn\'t much content in the mod itself, but everything that is there looks unusual and interesting.\\n\\nI plan to update the mod with the release of new versions of AA.\\n\\nContent:\\n**Dishes:**\\n- Red Bamboo Stir-fry\\n- Puffball Soup\\n- Mossy Pancakes and Rust Mossy Pancakes\\n- Rabbit Sandwich\\n- Poreshroom on Log\\n- Stuffed Gourdnut\\n- Wisp Cheesecake\\n- Puffball Mushroom Crate","body_url":null,"published":"2025-10-03T05:37:24.551270Z","updated":"2025-10-03T05:43:32.122886Z","approved":"2025-10-12T09:07:28.651016Z","queued":"2025-10-06T16:40:26.786977Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":7745,"followers":46,"categories":["decoration","food","game-mechanics"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["neoforge"],"versions":["5m0DluJ1"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/365e987413bfcdb14b0cf6f9edf62fe673c5498f_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/365e987413bfcdb14b0cf6f9edf62fe673c5498f.png","issues_url":"https://github.com/Magafin/Abundant_Delight/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/Magafin/Abundant_Delight","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[{"id":"ko-fi","platform":"Ko-fi","url":"https://ko-fi.com/magafin"}],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/images/a8cb71d9444d4542055c8b2395950ee3bbc4f63f_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/images/a8cb71d9444d4542055c8b2395950ee3bbc4f63f.png","featured":true,"title":"Wisp Cheesecake","description":null,"created":"2025-10-03T06:06:06.187344Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/images/f7b00840c1b0d4356ad7a92c89c819ef8fdcf075_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/images/f7b00840c1b0d4356ad7a92c89c819ef8fdcf075.png","featured":false,"title":"Stuffed Gourdnut","description":"also used No Man\'s Land for screenshot","created":"2025-10-03T06:07:38.354736Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/images/571768daa56c3a3c9fde9ce06f51d9defa62610c_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ey816bd/images/571768daa56c3a3c9fde9ce06f51d9defa62610c.png","featured":false,"title":"Puffball Mushrooms","description":null,"created":"2025-10-03T06:08:03.403851Z","ordering":0}],"color":6441518,"thread_id":"UjDXF1wa","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","game_versions":["1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8"],"environment":[],"id":"zLwMv5nD","slug":"take-my-pixels","project_type":"resourcepack","team":"2laDYVxY","organization":null,"title":"Take My Pixels","description":"An overlay pack that can be used to downscale any other resourcepack (or vanilla)","body":"Do you like the style of Minecraft in a lower resolution like 8x8 but also want to use your favorite resource packs? Then this pack might be something for you! It uses shaders to apply a downscaling filter on top of whatever resource pack you are using, whether thats a custom one or the vanilla textures.\\n\\nThe pack can downscale from any source resolution to any downscaled resolution. Even non power of two values like 12 pixels per block work.\\n\\n_Because the downscaling is automatic and not manually created, there might be some issues with smaller details since the shader doesn\'t know which pixel is an important detail and what is just a normal part of the texture._","body_url":null,"published":"2025-11-17T19:18:10.190252Z","updated":"2025-11-17T20:04:08.199294Z","approved":"2025-11-20T01:58:20.521495Z","queued":"2025-11-17T20:08:41.923962Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":145,"followers":14,"categories":["core-shaders","simplistic","tweaks"],"additional_categories":["8x-","blocks","themed"],"loaders":["minecraft"],"versions":["Zv6LUaJ7"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/cbe9a23b3ba740f94935f0214aaca77ac502fa1a_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/cbe9a23b3ba740f94935f0214aaca77ac502fa1a.png","issues_url":"https://github.com/Dragoncraft000/Take-My-Pixels/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/Dragoncraft000/Take-My-Pixels","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/4be68166ef1cd70be3acfda1f3aced8662ff3808_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/4be68166ef1cd70be3acfda1f3aced8662ff3808.png","featured":true,"title":"Vanilla Nether","description":"The vanilla nether environment downscaled to 8x8","created":"2025-11-17T19:34:51.851813Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/de0fcafc37631d5228e144e4e9cb6b20945eed8d_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/de0fcafc37631d5228e144e4e9cb6b20945eed8d.png","featured":false,"title":"Vanilla Forest","description":"The vanilla textures downscaled to 8x8","created":"2025-11-17T19:30:13.105256Z","ordering":1},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/50de7801686be820d64ceb05463926449faeed30_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/50de7801686be820d64ceb05463926449faeed30.png","featured":false,"title":"Ashen Forest","description":"A  forest scene using the Ashen resource pack downscaled to 8x8","created":"2025-11-17T19:31:32.377397Z","ordering":2},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/023a1ed6634a0ef5412d46589aaeea7fb20c5c2a_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/023a1ed6634a0ef5412d46589aaeea7fb20c5c2a.png","featured":false,"title":"Alacrity Plains","description":"A plains scene using the Alacrity resource pack downscaled to 8x8","created":"2025-11-17T19:32:17.481267Z","ordering":3},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/092a5bee18329adb8737e338f0a015d40c0dd77e_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/092a5bee18329adb8737e338f0a015d40c0dd77e.png","featured":false,"title":"Ashen Stronghold","description":"A Stronghold with the Ashen resource pack in 8x8 resolution","created":"2025-11-17T19:36:24.872085Z","ordering":4},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/783728b441284f0e060ec043ac1803ec916d8e0d_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zLwMv5nD/images/783728b441284f0e060ec043ac1803ec916d8e0d.png","featured":false,"title":"Programmer Art Jungle","description":"A jungle with the Programmer Art Continuation resourcepack downscaled to 8x8","created":"2025-11-17T19:34:00.924899Z","ordering":5}],"color":4929837,"thread_id":"KfOJwBBX","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"unsupported","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.10","1.21.11","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9"],"environment":["server_only"],"id":"OIjJpimJ","slug":"worldevils","project_type":"mod","team":"7RWlZ9OZ","organization":null,"title":"World Evils","description":"This project adds the world evils from terraria!","body":"# World Evils\\n\\nTerraria\'s Corruption, Crimson and Hallow in Minecraft! (Its not exactly the same)\\n\\nYour world gets one of the two evils. Which one is decided by the seed and you don\'t get to choose. every world is a Corruption world or a Crimson world, never both. You\'ll\\nfind out which the first time you open the right chest in a nether\\nfortress.\\n\\nInside there are seeds. Plant one somewhere you don\'t mind losing, or in your friend\'s base to troll them :)\\n\\n## It spreads!\\n\\nit spreads slowly. You\'ll plant it, nothing much will happen, and you\'ll forget about it.\\nThen you come back from mining and your whole garden is purple and thorny.\\n\\nIt takes almost every block, including artificial ones.\\n\\nIt also keeps going while you\'re not looking. Walking away doesn\'t pause it.\\n(There\'s a page in the options menu if you\'d rather it went easier on your\\nhardware. Cap it, let it throttle itself, or switch that off entirely.)\\n\\n## What lives out there\\n\\nThings that used to be something else, mostly. (Almost) Anything standing on infected\\nground long enough transforms into whatever the infection has a use for.\\n\\nThere are altars in the caves, the only place evil gear can be made. And you may find other floating things, just be careful how many you break in a row.\\n\\nBring a fishing rod at some point, there\'s good fishies on infected waters ;)\\n\\n## The Hallow\\n\\nEvery world has it, and its seeds aren\'t in\\nthe nether. Look in ominous trial chambers instead.\\n\\nPlant it and you get the opposite of everything above. Light blue grass, trees that\\ncan\'t pick a colour, water that went completely magenta, and crystals in the caves\\ndoing your torch\'s job for you.\\n\\nIt\'s also where the mod stops being nice about it. What lives in the Hallow hits\\nharder than anything in the Corruption or the Crimson, and it expects you to turn\\nup in gear you took off them first. Wandering in wearing iron is a decision you get\\nto make once.\\n\\nIt\'s got two big ones of its own. One of them you can set off completely by\\naccident, so watch what you swing at. \\n\\nBy default all three keep to their own blocks and won\'t eat each other\'s. There\'s a\\nswitch in the options if you\'d rather they fought about it.\\n\\n**Requires Fabric API, Satin and GeckoLib, and Melody if you want music.**\\nAll music is a cover of its terraria counterpart, in piano. Credits to Re-Logic and its peak music.\\n\\nIf you use Xaero\'s minimap, everything in here has an icon for it.","body_url":null,"published":"2026-08-07T17:45:53.557823Z","updated":"2026-09-01T11:39:20.780213Z","approved":"2026-08-24T18:37:45.316978Z","queued":"2026-08-07T19:13:34.283122Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":177,"followers":8,"categories":["adventure","game-mechanics","mobs"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["fabric"],"versions":["lYwEHn03","hDBcZEFF","T839gvQQ","c75bUQzK","UR8s9U2m"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/64adcaa365a35f76cf7fe5322d97a993f7c84fe3_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/64adcaa365a35f76cf7fe5322d97a993f7c84fe3.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/350afd21e2daf4a23069cc55c51b79f50e2023e3_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/350afd21e2daf4a23069cc55c51b79f50e2023e3.png","featured":false,"title":"The Crimson","description":"the crimson biome. Solas Shaders are on.","created":"2026-08-07T19:05:06.472718Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/f98dbb67793592a4fa80f0d65626e77287968ed7_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/f98dbb67793592a4fa80f0d65626e77287968ed7.png","featured":true,"title":"Corruption","description":"The corruption biome. Solas shaders are on.","created":"2026-08-07T19:05:30.670954Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/bf7172a9e6c30b0076729faa4b6c2dbe4864dfa9_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/bf7172a9e6c30b0076729faa4b6c2dbe4864dfa9.jpeg","featured":false,"title":"Underground Hallow","description":"the underground hallow with solas shaders.","created":"2026-08-11T17:11:59.163547Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/81fb2c8748b0e36705c0307e1386603e24a388bd_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/81fb2c8748b0e36705c0307e1386603e24a388bd.jpeg","featured":false,"title":"The Hallow","description":"The Hallow biome with solas shaders.","created":"2026-08-11T17:12:38.436310Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/47e9d42ed4017195b607c26f95ce6844265dd14f_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/47e9d42ed4017195b607c26f95ce6844265dd14f.jpeg","featured":false,"title":"Underground Crimson","description":"Underground crimson with solas shaders on.","created":"2026-08-11T17:13:05.341056Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/0f45d49b7f67b80d9dbc6a00a562a418fb7e5597_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/0f45d49b7f67b80d9dbc6a00a562a418fb7e5597.jpeg","featured":false,"title":"Underground corruption","description":"Underground corruption with Solas Shaders on.","created":"2026-08-11T17:13:32.570937Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/a72ec4c069358ed201cfd5800c2f55931ae28b44_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/a72ec4c069358ed201cfd5800c2f55931ae28b44.png","featured":false,"title":"Underground Icon","description":null,"created":"2026-08-11T17:14:03.767904Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/64adcaa365a35f76cf7fe5322d97a993f7c84fe3_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OIjJpimJ/images/64adcaa365a35f76cf7fe5322d97a993f7c84fe3.png","featured":false,"title":"Surface Icon","description":null,"created":"2026-08-11T17:14:22.512561Z","ordering":0}],"color":4401224,"thread_id":"OHQFfpYL","monetization_status":"demonetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["26.1.2"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"UkT2puez","slug":"caustics","project_type":"mod","team":"cc6rrPFz","organization":null,"title":"Caustics","description":"New crystals and an infraustructure-based transportation system. What more could you want?","body":"<div style=\\"text-align: center;\\"> <center>\\n  \\n![Fancy Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c27b62acf25dbb5f755835d13cc94f4d517eaeb.png)\\n  \\n<h2>\\n<b>New crystals and an infraustructure-based transportation system. What more could you want?</b>\\n</h2>\\n<br>\\n<a href=\\"\\">\\n<img alt=\\"modrinth\\" height=\\"56\\" src=\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\\">\\n</a>\\n<a href=\\"https://github.com/Ramixin/Caustics\\">\\n<img alt=\\"github\\" height=\\"56\\" src=\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\\">\\n</a>\\n<br>\\n<img alt=\\"fabric\\" height=\\"40\\" src=\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/supported/fabric_vector.svg\\">\\n<img alt=\\"no forge\\" height=\\"40\\" src=\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/unsupported/forge_vector.svg\\">\\n</center>\\n</div>\\n\\nCaustics add several new crystal types. The cluster from each type can be joined together by any crystal block to form a node. Each crystal type has its own purpose:\\n\\n\\n| Crystal Type | Purpose                                                                          |\\n|--------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n| Sapphire     | Makes a node discoverable with the alidade                                       |\\n| Beryl        | Used to craft the alidade                                                        |\\n| Peridot      | Defines where the player is teleported to when a node is used                    |\\n| Topaz        | Extends the range that alidades can see nodes                                    |\\n| Sunstone     | Adds the node to a network. Alidades can be tuned to only see a specific network |\\n| Selenite     | Stores light that enables nodes or leapers to work in low light levels           |\\n| Tourmaline   | Jams all signals that attempt to cross the signal range boundary                 |\\n\\n## License\\n\\n---\\nThis project is under an MIT license","body_url":null,"published":"2026-07-19T15:15:20.328719Z","updated":"2026-08-12T19:47:25.791123Z","approved":"2026-07-24T02:59:41.180178Z","queued":"2026-07-20T14:57:13.292212Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":"https://github.com/Ramixin/Caustics/blob/master/LICENSE.txt"},"downloads":307,"followers":8,"categories":["magic","technology","transportation"],"additional_categories":["decoration"],"loaders":["fabric"],"versions":["gvx3kvFv","8HqnWDfu","ktCGDWo0"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/9f2466b890c2e917d1de1fea9e63f6493e1d21c5.png","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/9f2466b890c2e917d1de1fea9e63f6493e1d21c5.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":"https://github.com/Ramixin/Caustics","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/cbcef0dc688fbf9652caec1bb9576f84def4c9fb_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/cbcef0dc688fbf9652caec1bb9576f84def4c9fb.png","featured":false,"title":"Crystals","description":"Look! Pretty Crystal Blocks! Much building options, much awesome","created":"2026-07-20T14:38:58.607015Z","ordering":-2},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/667c93e1b78b464bf21e414d9f321cf83b55647a_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/667c93e1b78b464bf21e414d9f321cf83b55647a.png","featured":false,"title":"Beryl Geode","description":"All crystals sold seperately","created":"2026-07-20T14:40:33.431839Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/0da97aff0219fe75e2e08f50513b2a09d9803da8_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/0da97aff0219fe75e2e08f50513b2a09d9803da8.png","featured":false,"title":"Alidade","description":"Look at those lovely nodes!","created":"2026-07-20T14:42:53.948169Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/375af7291edc89a9544af36eea6d1aa6e7d00ade_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/375af7291edc89a9544af36eea6d1aa6e7d00ade.png","featured":false,"title":"Identify and Select","description":"Never forget again!","created":"2026-07-20T14:48:13.466809Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/d31b5ae49837d880f52c6cc146782a35719aa69b_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UkT2puez/images/d31b5ae49837d880f52c6cc146782a35719aa69b.png","featured":false,"title":"Seeing Double","description":"Meet your twin as you transfer yourself over the crystal network!","created":"2026-07-20T14:52:07.602391Z","ordering":0}],"color":10331388,"thread_id":"pPGH0s0v","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","game_versions":["1.21.10","1.21.11","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"environment":["client_only"],"id":"YgMgdcqs","slug":"creativecraftingmenus","project_type":"mod","team":"ZslaqsBl","organization":null,"title":"Creative Crafting Menus","description":"A creative mode QoL mod adding easily accessible crafting menus modified for better creative mode use","body":"Adds several crafting menus to the creative inventory, each designed for ease of use in creative mode. Also adds* a 2x2 crafting grid to the creative mode survival inventory\\n\\n<sub>*It was always in the game, just moved 2000 pixels up and to the left from the screen, lol. The mod just moves it back.</sub>\\n\\n<hr>\\n<h3>Crafting Menus</h3>\\n\\n| Image | Description |\\n| :---: | :--- |\\n| ![Anvil menu](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/954154ef920604be500ea870dcadb4d399510c42.png) | **Anvil** <br><br> Contains two pages. One lets you easily edit an item\'s name & lore, with text formatting using <a href=\\"https://modrinth.com/mod/placeholder-api\\">Placeholder API</a>. <br><br> The other lets you add, remove, and modify enchantments. |\\n| ![Crafting menu](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/619bdb3afae515f13ce0fc2717d619688dc6bedb.png) | **Crafting** <br><br> A basic 3x3 crafting grid. Loads vanilla recipes when on a server. |\\n| ![Loom menu](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/69e7c5694521fdcdaaa5f9364d3d5ec6a0e6b096.png) | **Loom** <br><br> Banner editing suite. Lets you easily create, modify, and save banners. Contains many built-in banner presets for all your vexillology needs! |\\n| ![Smithing menu](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/70653d0838566f57a78bac19d891586ce1ab38b8.png) | **Smithing** <br><br> Customize gear here! Pages for trim pattern, trim material, and item material. |\\n\\n<hr>\\n\\nEverything can be configured in-game with [YACL](https://modrinth.com/mod/yacl).","body_url":null,"published":"2026-02-11T21:17:45.248570Z","updated":"2026-10-16T16:17:17.982687Z","approved":"2026-02-12T03:36:11.490142Z","queued":"2026-02-11T23:11:16.668530Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":10456,"followers":65,"categories":["decoration","utility"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["fabric"],"versions":["Zqunhe4B","R3U4ed7H","l4eladC9","4gtV3zsJ","BYyN7TT3","ScA9fUlM","pCEQqiYa","Ue0JMJrw","Za2GBw8X","6JEGX6X1","ebd40fdd","LQW7nq15","J6jybzbb","5I7lQLHT","McZBakL4","lgtuTOsq","bCiVEZqc","e4FQLeXq","weC9QU1H","7978jwyV","R2f6636X","oJvDJW52","u1DLjJfB"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/e451e05ce1bac50dab18d56d42a5d226f7d30417_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/e451e05ce1bac50dab18d56d42a5d226f7d30417.png","issues_url":"https://codeberg.org/chililisoup/CreativeCraftingMenus/issues","source_url":"https://codeberg.org/chililisoup/CreativeCraftingMenus","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/69e7c5694521fdcdaaa5f9364d3d5ec6a0e6b096.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/69e7c5694521fdcdaaa5f9364d3d5ec6a0e6b096.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Loom menu","created":"2026-02-11T22:48:05.226142Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/70653d0838566f57a78bac19d891586ce1ab38b8.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/70653d0838566f57a78bac19d891586ce1ab38b8.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Smithing menu","created":"2026-02-11T22:48:24.534191Z","ordering":1},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/954154ef920604be500ea870dcadb4d399510c42.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/954154ef920604be500ea870dcadb4d399510c42.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Anvil menu","created":"2026-02-11T22:48:42.560295Z","ordering":2},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/619bdb3afae515f13ce0fc2717d619688dc6bedb.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/619bdb3afae515f13ce0fc2717d619688dc6bedb.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Crafting menu","created":"2026-02-11T22:48:52.601038Z","ordering":3},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/c29b5978d140f5a635688ca0bb40c01bdec60d03.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/c29b5978d140f5a635688ca0bb40c01bdec60d03.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Creative inventory crafting","created":"2026-02-11T22:49:11.022712Z","ordering":4},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/e172b2a9f8e21684ecda04bcbe4eb8a3d3d3533e.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YgMgdcqs/images/e172b2a9f8e21684ecda04bcbe4eb8a3d3d3533e.png","featured":false,"title":null,"description":"Page for one of the built-in banner preset groups","created":"2026-02-11T22:52:49.494052Z","ordering":5}],"color":4535855,"thread_id":"2ldaSGYL","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"optional","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.10","1.21.11","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2"],"environment":["server_only","server_only_client_optional","unknown"],"id":"qu5fskN5","slug":"unbound-items","project_type":"mod","team":"aFEwuyrn","organization":null,"title":"Unbound: Items","description":"Versatile, yet intuitive new tools, equipment, & amulets, providing new survival playstyles, exploration incentives and resource usage.","body":"\\n\\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f1895f64db7ae1aec04121d2b2b4d77bb9822865.png)\\n\\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00664348bea9bb819c3bf9c29581078665d0be81.png)\\n- Note: This datapack also has resource pack functionality. Add it as both a datapack (to your world) and to your resource pack menu (client menu/or server resourcepack) to correctly display custom item and mob textures.\\n- Mod version has built-in automatic resourcepack functionality\\n\\n# About\\n\\nAdds **20 New Items**, composed of tools, equipment, amulets, and consumables that enhance playstyles, reward world exploration, and expand purpose of existing vanilla resources.\\n\\n***\\n\\n- **Playstyles:** New forms of movement, building, and combat aid expand playstyles in a variety of ways. Crowd control mobs with Bombs - Pull in out of reach items with a Magnet - Perform a charge jump with Rabbit Boots to aid in building... or initiating a Mace attack. Items are easy to understand, but versatile. Each item maintains vanilla progression and are  balanced to not be overpowered or overshadow other vanilla items.\\n\\n- **Vanilla Resources:** Existing resources lacking incentive have been expanded through these items additions. For example, Amethyst Shards are made more useful now through the crafting and usage of them with new items like Spectral Bottle, Sculk Radar, and Fairy in a Bottle. The Heart of the Sea can be alternatively used for the Amulet of the Sea movement item. Beetroot can be crafted into regenerating Golden Beetroot.\\n\\n- **Exploration:** Items can be common or found in unique situations. Find commmon items like Bombs, Golden Beetroot, and Spectral Bottles across most overworld loot chests, but also find specific unique loot like the Stealth Hood in igloos and the Necrotic Amulet in bastions. **4 new mobs** are also added to provide slots for new item obtainment in unique scenarios, such as from Glow Slimes in deep caves, Phantom Riders during thunderstorms, or Fairies from flower forests.\\n\\n\\n## Total Features\\n\\n7 Consumeables\\n6 Equipment\\n3 Tools\\n4 Amulets\\n4 Mobs\\n\\n# Wiki\\n\\nFind info about each item and how to obtain it in the wiki below\\n\\nhttps://github.com/limesplatus/unbound/wiki\\n\\n# Commands\\n\\nObtain items with operator command `/function unbound:__items`\\n\\n# Compatibility\\nUnbound Items can be found not only in vanilla chests, but in the following compatible mods/datapacks\' structure loot!\\n- Terralith\\n- Structory\\n- Strayed Fates: Forsaken\\n\\nUnbound maintains compatibility without overriding original loot tables through randomized function loot table injection for both vanilla & modded loot. Original loot & seed remains untouched - unbound items are simply injected randomly into newly opened container loot chests.\\n\\n\\n***\\n\\n![discord](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3a81bec138c36a57ea937c23d3478ecf01de0426.png)\\n\\nJoin the Discord Server to chat, discuss, and get help with my mods!\\n\\nhttps://discord.gg/XZVARKkjwt\\n\\n![image](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/52b59c5fe6e8fa9108d478bf6f9df7e9e1e5a7b4.png)\\n\\nHelp support the making of my datapacks with memberships or donations on Ko-fi!\\n\\nhttps://ko-fi.com/limesplatus/tiers\\n\\n*Many items heavily inspired by Terraria & Zelda BOTW items*","body_url":null,"published":"2026-05-23T19:06:43.880989Z","updated":"2026-07-23T01:10:12.253014Z","approved":"2026-05-24T05:32:53.335746Z","queued":"2026-05-23T20:39:29.507253Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"unlisted","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-Custom","name":"","url":"https://github.com/limesplatus/Vanilla-Refresh/wiki/License"},"downloads":2916,"followers":37,"categories":["adventure","equipment","magic"],"additional_categories":["food","mobs","transportation","utility"],"loaders":["datapack","fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt"],"versions":["7fF8JC5f","jNT5QWLk","dzJTRT9p","ZwQnRjtc","fk71iHNK","fDSJWEmu","3svngw9e","KtfynZ2t","f9B0gGlT","Ge58V3sz","WZFSPeQ5","vUcSCz2V","KQV4ImRp","NGY7Wn9k","G7n8Nl9j","ExKgPvtb"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/44337f466a08fff29ac5d537ef6a7a0f26caab7b_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/44337f466a08fff29ac5d537ef6a7a0f26caab7b.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/ffd32003a127158d34b8575636ae0cfaf469e9a3_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/ffd32003a127158d34b8575636ae0cfaf469e9a3.png","featured":false,"title":"Items in Use","description":"1st: Spectral Bottle - 2nd: Spectre Boots - 3rd: Strider Boots - 4th: Phantom Cloak","created":"2026-05-23T20:58:53.460611Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/2ad653f5dc1ca59909855f2bfb7e3d7a1029549f.png","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/2ad653f5dc1ca59909855f2bfb7e3d7a1029549f.png","featured":false,"title":"All Items","description":null,"created":"2026-05-23T20:59:49.167107Z","ordering":0},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/a4d537215a31f341f706fc62918b2c67e7f25f6e_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/a4d537215a31f341f706fc62918b2c67e7f25f6e.png","featured":false,"title":"Loot Compatibility","description":"Find Unbound loot in mods Terralith, Structory, and Forsaken","created":"2026-05-23T23:35:39.185117Z","ordering":33},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/e80e2289fac29ef1bf4ab70fefb40d9fee7d86d7_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qu5fskN5/images/e80e2289fac29ef1bf4ab70fefb40d9fee7d86d7.png","featured":true,"title":null,"description":null,"created":"2026-05-28T02:35:13.811442Z","ordering":333}],"color":564411,"thread_id":"94tNXJok","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20.1","1.21.1","1.21.8"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"lFJjN89u","slug":"state-machine","project_type":"mod","team":"OQbtThDl","organization":null,"title":"State Machine","description":"Build a state machine in Minecraft!","body":"# State Machine Mod\\n\\nWith this mod you can build a [deterministic finite-state machine](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deterministic_finite_automaton) in Minecraft.\\n\\nThe set of items (NOT ITEM STACKS) in your game is your alphabet. States are placed blocks.\\nIf a state is the current one of some state machine it will emit redstone signal.\\n\\n## Operations\\n\\n- **Create Transition**: Hold an item in the offhand and any wrench (state machine tool) in the main hand, then right‑click two state blocks. The first clicked block is the source state, the second is the target state.\\n- **Create Default Transition**: Same as creating a transition, but with an empty offhand.\\n- **Remove Transition**: Hold an item in the offhand and use any wrench (state machine tool) to right‑click a state block whose transition you want to remove. If the offhand is empty, the default transition is removed.\\n- **Set State Machine Block State**: Right‑click a state machine block with any wrench (state machine tool), then right‑click the target state.\\n","body_url":null,"published":"2026-02-12T14:02:11.516960Z","updated":"2026-02-13T14:17:27.162425Z","approved":"2026-02-17T21:06:38.040170Z","queued":"2026-02-13T03:05:45.126580Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LGPL-3.0-or-later","name":"GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later","url":null},"downloads":258,"followers":4,"categories":["technology","utility"],"additional_categories":[],"loaders":["fabric"],"versions":["M9ZsfAcv","8qR6fuVl","p1tozRH2","sbexDWKA","cwNCuIpd","JOi6UsTO","S3ckhrge","aGkdpFZf","7hL8kLOR","qRtCFpUk"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lFJjN89u/659de39a5e014b39483af3992ab17f0849e1703a_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lFJjN89u/659de39a5e014b39483af3992ab17f0849e1703a.png","issues_url":"https://codeberg.org/heipiao233/state-machine-mod/issues","source_url":"https://codeberg.org/heipiao233/state-machine-mod","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lFJjN89u/images/69b9f238b0e595c7596360efee1f8784a944722d_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lFJjN89u/images/69b9f238b0e595c7596360efee1f8784a944722d.png","featured":true,"title":"Aho–Corasick algorithm","description":"This is an implementation of [Aho–Corasick algorithm](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aho%E2%80%93Corasick_algorithm).\\nUsing Create Mod for I/O.","created":"2026-02-12T14:19:55.299858Z","ordering":0}],"color":4260868,"thread_id":"D12mMJWS","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"QLLc3CPu","slug":"joenikpsy","project_type":"mod","team":"1UbZknTv","organization":null,"title":"Joenikpsy End Update","description":"Adds Baby Ender Dragon, Grown Endermites, a New Biome and a New Structure","body":"<center>\\n  \\n![The Joenikpsy End Update Logo.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd1cc52d5e29a6cc6b1891ee139946e259e6620e.png)\\nThe End hasn\'t been updated for **a whole decade**.\\n\\nThis mod adds a **complete End Update** to Minecraft, featuring:\\n\\n• **Baby Ender Dragon**\\n\\n• **Mite Midlands Biome**\\n\\n• **Mite Manor Structure**\\n\\n• **Grown Endermites**\\n\\n• **Boss Endermite**\\n\\n# Trailer\\n<iframe width=\\"560\\" height=\\"315\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/seW9FnvNRa0\\" title=\\"YouTube video player\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n\\n### [German YouTube Video About The Mod (click here) ](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GW80X8OkER8&)\\n\\n# Explanation\\nAfter beating the Ender Dragon, you will find a redesigned Dragon Egg.\\n\\nCollect it, place it anywhere yourself and wait. After 3 minutes, the Baby Ender Dragon will hatch.\\n\\nIt will automatically be tamed by the nearest player while hatching. Right click the Dragon to make him sit.\\n\\nThe Baby Dragon teleports with you through End Gateways.\\n\\nFeed it with Chorus Fruit to make him lead you to the nearest Mite Manor (the new structure).\\n\\nIf you can\'t keep up with the dragon, it\'ll wait for you (if you\'re not in 30 blocks range anymore).\\n\\nIn the Mite Manor, you will find stairs leading down to tunnels where the Grown Endermites live.\\n\\nThere\'s a small chance you\'ll find a small cave in the tunnels. There, the Boss Endermite is protecting rare Enderite loot.\\n\\nYou can find the Enderite Ore in any Mite Midlands biome underground just like other normal ores.","body_url":null,"published":"2026-01-10T17:33:15.588114Z","updated":"2026-01-10T17:40:58.514052Z","approved":"2026-01-16T02:52:30.324230Z","queued":"2026-01-11T01:24:32.449620Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved","name":"","url":null},"downloads":1444,"followers":38,"categories":["adventure","mobs","worldgen"],"additional_categories":["equipment"],"loaders":["fabric"],"versions":["OqwTV7u5"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/94493ced04d83c9bf87eaba11b1617ff7dbecb26_96.webp","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/94493ced04d83c9bf87eaba11b1617ff7dbecb26.jpeg","issues_url":"https://github.com/AngelDGr/Joenikpsy-End-Update/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/AngelDGr/Joenikpsy-End-Update","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/35edc04cf150fb3ecdde7718abec9bc27564d960_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/35edc04cf150fb3ecdde7718abec9bc27564d960.png","featured":false,"title":"Baby Ender Dragon","description":null,"created":"2026-01-10T22:43:27.975974Z","ordering":1},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/40f2629f68f95d174bd35a4a7a929e488eb08625_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/40f2629f68f95d174bd35a4a7a929e488eb08625.png","featured":false,"title":"Mite Manor","description":null,"created":"2026-01-10T21:01:52.691955Z","ordering":2},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/943f1c26b8d826cdace296d3ff14c68e845019f3_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/943f1c26b8d826cdace296d3ff14c68e845019f3.png","featured":false,"title":"Mite Manor Tunnels","description":null,"created":"2026-01-10T21:02:02.471602Z","ordering":3},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/0ecf8c4fd7b6ae23e05c181ccf4fbe36f5a4603a_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/0ecf8c4fd7b6ae23e05c181ccf4fbe36f5a4603a.png","featured":false,"title":"Mite Midlands","description":null,"created":"2026-01-10T21:02:23.027213Z","ordering":4},{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/448b1dbc2714c05d065db6440f23dcf72502f443_350.webp","raw_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QLLc3CPu/images/448b1dbc2714c05d065db6440f23dcf72502f443.png","featured":false,"title":"Mite Midlands Aerial View","description":null,"created":"2026-01-10T22:40:50.354253Z","ordering":5}],"color":1380632,"thread_id":"1NCiQOoG","monetization_status":"monetized"},{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.21.1"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"cDSvl6iV","slug":"sable-collapsing-caves","project_type":"mod","team":"eoCmTBL4","organization":null,"title":"Sable: Collapsing Caves","description":"Port of the Collapsing Caves mod with Sable physics for cave-ins.","body":"<center>\\n\\n![Banner for CollapsingCaves](https://github.com/ccdelic1/collapsingcaves/blob/main/ImageBlocks/sableVersion.jpg?raw=true)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### ⚠️ NOTICE ⚠️\\n\\n<br>\\n\\nThis page description **ONLY LISTS THE DIFFERENCES** between base [Collapsing Caves](https://modrinth.com/mod/collapsing-caves) and this version.\\n\\nThis is the [Sable](https://modrinth.com/mod/sable) description of Collapsing Caves. It does not repeat the parts that stay the same. \\n\\nFor that, go see [Collapsing Caves](https://modrinth.com/mod/collapsing-caves). The other page has the full description. \\n\\n![Player getting pinned by a Cave-In](https://github.com/ccdelic1/collapsingcaves/blob/main/ImageBlocks/sable1.gif?raw=true)\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n**THIS MOD IS LIKELY TO HAVE BUGS AND ISSUES. REPORT ISSUES TO THE [ISSUE TRACKER](https://github.com/ccdelic1/collapsingcaves/issues) FOR REGULAR COLLAPSING CAVES BUT SPECIFY IF YOU\'RE ON SABLE THE SABLE VERSION.**\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n</center>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n<br> These parts do **not** change: \\n- How a cave-in starts.\\n- The chance of 1 in 512.\\n- The warning of 3 seconds.\\n- The rules that permit a cave-in.\\n- The height limit.\\n- The grace period.\\n- The cooldown(s).\\n- The three sizes and their times and distances.\\n- The **Gentle** enchantment.\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n<center>\\n  \\n### Sable & Sable: Ragdolls\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n![Player getting knocked into a hole by a cave-in.](https://github.com/ccdelic1/collapsingcaves/blob/main/ImageBlocks/sable2.gif?raw=true)\\n\\nThe mod does not start without [Sable](https://modrinth.com/mod/sable). \\n\\nThis is the one new mod that you must have. \\n\\nHowever, [Sable: Ragdolls](https://modrinth.com/mod/sable-ragdolls) is supported and recommended.\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n### The Blocks Now Have Physics\\nThis is the largest change.\\n\\n![A Cave-In From Afar](https://github.com/ccdelic1/collapsingcaves/blob/main/ImageBlocks/sable3.gif?raw=true)\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n| Before | Now |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| A block fell straight down at **two fifths** of the usual speed. | A block is a physics body. It turns while it falls. |\\n| A block stopped where it landed. | A block hits the other blocks that fall with it, it rolls across the ground and it comes to rest where the physics put it. |\\n| The blocks made a flat layer. | The blocks make a pile. Two cave-ins never give the same pile. |\\n\\n<br> Each piece also receives a turn and a small push when it comes away from the ceiling. The\\npieces therefore come apart from each other, and they land on a corner and roll.\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n</center>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n### Groups Of Blocks\\nA cave-in no longer drops each block on its own. Some pieces are one block. Other pieces are a\\ngroup of blocks that stay together and move as one body.\\n\\n* A piece near the centre of the cave-in is one block more often.\\n* A piece near the outer edge is a group more often. A group holds a way out of the cave better\\n  than the same number of single blocks, because single blocks roll away from each other.\\n* A group starts above a corridor or a way out more often than above a large open space. A\\n  cave-in can therefore close the ways out and hold you inside it.\\n* The first seconds give the largest groups. A large group stays inside a box of 4 blocks on\\n  each axis and can hold as many as 64 blocks. Later pieces are smaller.\\n\\n<br> The mod keeps approximately **300** blocks as physics blocks while a cave-in continues.\\nAbove that number, the oldest blocks go back into the world to make room for the new ones. This\\nkeeps the speed of the server.\\n\\n<center>\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n![Group of blocks falling in a Cave-In](https://github.com/ccdelic1/collapsingcaves/blob/main/ImageBlocks/sable4.gif?raw=true)\\n\\n</center>\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n### The Blocks Go Back Into The World\\nThis is new. The blocks do not stay physics blocks for all time.\\n\\n* The blocks stay physics blocks while the cave-in continues.\\n* They then go back into the world as usual blocks, in the position where they came to rest.\\n* This work waits until every player is outside the cave-in.\\n* The work then puts the blocks back a few at a time. A small cave-in needs **8 seconds**, a\\n  medium one needs **15 seconds** and a large one needs **23 seconds**.\\n* A player who comes back inside the cave-in stops the work. The work continues when that\\n  player leaves again. You therefore never see a block change in front of you.\\n* Each piece turns and moves into its final position across half of one second. The blocks do\\n  not jump into place.\\n* A sound plays while this work continues, and it stops with the last block.\\n\\n<br> The blocks are also safe from a stop of the server. The mod writes a record with each piece\\ninto the world file. A piece from an earlier session comes back into the world when you return\\nto that place.\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n<center>\\n\\n![Blocks cleaning themselves up.](https://github.com/ccdelic1/collapsingcaves/blob/main/ImageBlocks/sable5.gif?raw=true)\\n\\n</center>\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n### Damage\\nThe damage of a falling block is different. For this version, being hit by blocks does 1 heart of damage only.\\n\\n<br> The block must move at decent speed to harm you. This speed is the momentum built up when a block falls a height of one and one half blocks or more. A block at rest does no damage.\\n\\n<br> The blocks that lie on you are the greater danger. If the blocks cover you, suffocation\\ncauses more damage.\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n### New Things To See And Hear\\nA cave-in now changes the air and the ground around you.\\n\\n* **White ash** falls inside the cave-in while it continues.\\n* **Dust** comes up from a part of the floor inside the cave-in.\\n* **Fog** fills the air. The fog is thin at the start and becomes thicker across the first\\n  **8 seconds**, because the dust comes from the blocks that fall. It goes away across\\n  **14 seconds** after the cave-in ends.\\n* The ash, the dust and the fog are inside the cave-in only. A player above the cave, or below\\n  it, sees none of them.\\n* A block that hits the ground can make a **gust of air**.\\n* A block that lands beside you moves the camera, in the manner of the movement that damage\\n  gives it.\\n\\n<br> **Motion sickness mode** now stops the movement of the camera from a block as well as the\\nshake of the screen.\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n### Configuration\\nThe settings file has a new name and more settings in it.\\n\\nThe new settings control these things:\\n\\n* The number of physics blocks and the time that they need to go back into the world\\n* The size of the groups, and where in the cave-in they come away\\n* The turn and the push of the falling blocks\\n* The white ash, the dust from the floor, the fog and the gust of air\\n* The movement of the camera, and the ragdolls\\n\\n<br> Some settings are for your game only. The white ash, the dust, the fog and the movement of\\nthe camera are of this kind, and each player can hold a value of their own for them.\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n---\\n<br>\\n\\n<center>\\n\\n**Made by CCDelic.**\\n\\n<br>\\n\\n![The minecraft head of the mod author, CCDelic.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4a7b9bc354075663e2f489f6f42afdb2787a3afb.png)\\n\\n</center>\\n","body_url":null,"published":"2026-08-14T19:17:47.661917Z","updated":"2026-08-14T20:03:03.807995Z","approved":"2026-09-02T09:46:21.367053Z","queued":"2026-08-14T20:03:57.933121Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"CC0-1.0","name":"Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Univer